var e={deep:{priceTable:{title:`Deep Cleaning Charges in Gurgaon — Full Rate Card`,note:`These are our published deep cleaning rates, and the exact figure for your home is confirmed on the call before the slot is booked. Typical crew shown; larger or dirtier homes may need more.`,head:[`Home size`,`Charges`,`Time on site`,`What changes the price`],rows:[[`1 RK / studio`,`₹2,000`,`3–4 hrs`,`One room, kitchenette and bathroom`],[`1 BHK (400–600 sq ft)`,`₹2,500`,`4–5 hrs`,`One bathroom, one modular kitchen`],[`2 BHK (601–1,000 sq ft)`,`₹4,500`,`5–6 hrs`,`Two bathrooms, both fully descaled`],[`3 BHK (1,001–1,500 sq ft)`,`₹5,500`,`6–7 hrs`,`Third bedroom and AC vent detailing`],[`4 BHK (1,501–2,100 sq ft)`,`₹6,500`,`7–8 hrs`,`Marble-safe products, terrace scrub`],[`5 BHK / villa`,`₹9,000`,`8–9 hrs`,`Three or more bathrooms, garden edges`],[`Same scope by area`,`₹3–₹6 per sq ft`,`Scales with area`,`Any built-up size, pro-rata`],[`Furnished homes`,`Add ₹500–₹1,500`,`Adds 1–2 hrs`,`Sofa, dining units, extra wardrobes`]]},qa:[{q:`How much does deep cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`A 1 BHK deep clean in Gurgaon costs ₹2,500, a 2 BHK ₹4,500 and a 3 BHK ₹5,500, while a 4 BHK is ₹6,500 and a 5 BHK villa ₹9,000. A studio starts at ₹2,000, and the per-square-foot equivalent sits between ₹3 and ₹6. Machines, products, travel and the final walkthrough are all covered in that one figure.`},{q:`What is included in a full home deep cleaning?`,a:`A full home deep clean covers floors and tiles, walls, ceilings, ceiling fans, window glass and sills, furniture, and the inside of wardrobes and cupboards. The kitchen is degreased including the chimney filter, and every bathroom is descaled at the tiles, taps, commode and grout. Touch points are sanitised before a joint walkthrough.`},{q:`How long does deep cleaning take for a 1 BHK flat?`,a:`Four to five hours. A 1 BHK deep clean in Gurgaon runs 4–5 hours with a two-person team, which is enough for the kitchen degrease, one bathroom descale, bedroom and wardrobe detailing, window cleaning and a full floor scrub. A 2 BHK takes 5–6 hours with three cleaners, and a 3 BHK runs 6–7 hours with four.`},{q:`Is deep cleaning worth the price compared with regular house cleaning?`,a:`Yes, if you book deep cleaning two or three times a year and house cleaning in between. A weekly visit at ₹1,199 keeps surface dust down, but it cannot descale taps, degrease a chimney filter or lift dirt from inside cupboards. A deep clean resets that build-up, and most Gurgaon families pair the two on a quarterly rhythm.`},{q:`Gurgaon me deep cleaning ka kharcha kya hai?`,a:`Deep cleaning Gurgaon me ₹2,000 se shuru hoti hai — 1 RK ke liye ₹2,000, 1 BHK ₹2,500, 2 BHK ₹4,500 aur 3 BHK ₹5,500. 4 BHK ₹6,500 aur 5 BHK villa ₹9,000. Per square foot rate ₹3 se ₹6 aata hai. Machines, chemicals aur travel is price me already shaamil hain.`},{q:`How many cleaners are sent for a 3 BHK and how is the price calculated?`,a:`Three or four cleaners work on a 3 BHK deep clean, and the price is calculated by flat size. A 3 BHK in Gurgaon is 1,001–1,500 sq ft and costs ₹5,500 as a fixed package. Anything beyond the standard scope — extra bathrooms, balcony depth, heavy furniture — is quoted on the confirmation call before the crew is dispatched.`},{q:`How often should a Gurgaon home be deep cleaned?`,a:`Every three to six months. Construction dust, hard-water deposits and cooking grease build up faster in Gurgaon than in most cities, so a quarterly deep clean keeps a home manageable between visits. Families with children, pets or a second bathroom usually move to the shorter interval, while a single-occupant studio can stretch to two visits a year.`}],factors:{title:`What changes the final price`,items:[`Home size — the biggest driver, from ₹2,000 to ₹9,000`,`Number of bathrooms, since each one needs a full descale`,`Furniture volume — sofas, wardrobes and dining units add time`,`Current condition — months of built-up dust cost extra crew hours`,`Floor and tile type — marble needs softer products and pads`,`Add-ons like sofa shampoo, carpet extraction or window detailing`]}},house:{priceTable:{title:`House Cleaning Charges in Gurgaon — Per Visit Rate Card`,note:`These are our published per-visit house cleaning rates, and the exact figure is confirmed on the call before the slot is booked.`,head:[`Home size`,`Per visit`,`Time per visit`,`Plan options`],rows:[[`Studio / 1 RK`,`₹499`,`About 1 hour`,`One-time or weekly`],[`1 BHK`,`₹799`,`1.5–2 hours`,`Weekly, bi-weekly, monthly`],[`2 BHK`,`₹1,199`,`2–3 hours`,`Weekly, bi-weekly, monthly`],[`3 BHK`,`₹1,699`,`3–4 hours`,`Weekly, bi-weekly, monthly`],[`2 BHK on a weekly plan`,`About ₹1,000 per visit`,`2–3 hours`,`Recurring, same team`],[`Add-ons — dish wash, bed making, fridge`,`₹150–₹400`,`Extra 20–40 minutes`,`Charged per visit`]]},qa:[{q:`How much does house cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`House cleaning starts at ₹499 per visit for a studio or 1 RK. A 1 BHK is ₹799, a 2 BHK ₹1,199 and a 3 BHK ₹1,699 per visit, with machines, products and travel included in that figure. Weekly and bi-weekly plans bring the per-visit cost down, because the same crew and checklist are reused each time.`},{q:`What does a 2 BHK house cleaning visit cost per month on a weekly plan?`,a:`A 2 BHK house cleaning visit is ₹1,199 per visit, so a weekly plan works out at about ₹4,796 for the month, and a bi-weekly plan about ₹2,398. On a recurring booking the per-visit rate drops to roughly ₹1,000 because the same crew, checklist and travel are reused. The monthly figure is confirmed on the call before the plan starts.`},{q:`What is included in a standard house cleaning visit?`,a:`A standard house cleaning visit includes full dusting and vacuuming, mopping of all floors, kitchen surface wiping, bathroom cleaning, bin emptying with liner change, and sanitisation of high-touch surfaces. Balconies, utility areas and stairwells inside the home are covered too. Bed making and dish washing are available as add-ons.`},{q:`How long does a house cleaning visit take?`,a:`One to four hours, depending on size. A studio or 1 RK takes about an hour, a 1 BHK takes 1.5–2 hours, a 2 BHK takes 2–3 hours and a 3 BHK takes 3–4 hours. A first visit after a long gap runs longer because the home starts from a heavier build-up, and that extra time is quoted upfront.`},{q:`Should I book weekly or bi-weekly house cleaning, and which plan costs less per visit?`,a:`Bi-weekly suits most Gurgaon homes, and weekly suits homes near active construction, pet owners or cooking-heavy kitchens. Weekly keeps dust and oil mist from bonding, and a ₹1,199 bi-weekly 2 BHK visit works out cheaper than hiring a full-time helper. Monthly works best only as a supplement between quarterly deep cleans.`},{q:`Gurgaon me house cleaning ka kharcha kya hai?`,a:`House cleaning ₹499 se shuru hoti hai — studio ke liye ₹499, 1 BHK ₹799, 2 BHK ₹1,199 aur 3 BHK ₹1,699 per visit. Weekly plan me per-visit cost kam ho jati hai kyunki same team har baar aati hai. Machines, chemicals aur travel sab included hai, koi alag charge nahi lagta.`},{q:`How does house cleaning compare with a full-time maid in Gurgaon?`,a:`A live-in maid through an agency usually runs ₹12,000–₹18,000 a month plus the agency fee, and that person cannot descale, degrease a chimney or shampoo a sofa. A house cleaning plan at ₹1,199 a visit costs roughly ₹4,800 a month for a 2 BHK and reaches the surfaces a maid routine leaves behind.`},{q:`Can I get the same cleaner on every house cleaning visit?`,a:`Yes, on weekly and bi-weekly plans we assign the same team to your home so they learn your preferences and the visit runs faster. If a team member is unavailable we inform you in advance and send a substitute briefed on your checklist. One-time bookings cannot guarantee the same person, but the written checklist keeps quality consistent.`}],factors:{title:`What changes the final price`,items:[`Home size — the per-visit ladder runs ₹499 to ₹1,699`,`Frequency — regular plans lower the cost of each visit`,`Number of bathrooms and kitchen surfaces to maintain`,`Condition on arrival, especially the first visit after a gap`,`Add-ons such as dish washing, bed making or fridge shelves`,`Society access, parking and lift availability for the crew`]}},kitchen:{priceTable:{title:`Kitchen Deep Cleaning Charges in Gurgaon`,note:`Our published kitchen rate card — the final figure is confirmed on the call after a quick look at your kitchen layout.`,head:[`Kitchen scope`,`Charges`,`Time on site`,`Includes`],rows:[[`Standard modular kitchen`,`From ₹1,500`,`3–4 hours`,`Chimney filter dismantle and soak`],[`Large or island kitchen`,`₹2,500–₹3,500`,`4–5 hours`,`Hob, exhaust and cabinet interiors`],[`Chimney filter degreasing`,`Included`,`30–45 minutes`,`Filter removed, soaked, scrubbed`],[`Hob and countertop degrease`,`Included`,`30–40 minutes`,`Burners, knobs and splashback`],[`Cabinet inside-out wipe`,`Included`,`30–45 minutes`,`Corners where oil mist settles`],[`Grout and tile scrub`,`Included`,`30 minutes`,`Splashback and floor joints`],[`Oven interior deep clean`,`Add ₹400`,`30–45 minutes`,`Racks, glass and side panels`]]},qa:[{q:`How much does kitchen deep cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`Kitchen deep cleaning in Gurgaon starts at ₹1,500 for a standard modular kitchen and runs to ₹3,500 for a large or island kitchen. The chimney filter dismantle, filter soak, hob degrease, exhaust cleaning, cabinet interiors, splashback and grout scrub are all inside that figure. An oven interior deep clean is ₹400 extra.`},{q:`What exactly is included in a kitchen deep cleaning service?`,a:`The chimney filter is removed and soaked to release baked-on grease, the hob and exhaust fan are degreased, cabinet interiors are wiped out including the corners where oil mist collects, and the splashback, tiles and grout joints are scrubbed. We finish by wiping the countertop edges, cleaning the sink and sanitising the handles and switches.`},{q:`How long does kitchen deep cleaning take?`,a:`Three to four hours for a standard modular kitchen, and four to five hours for a large one with an island and a built-in oven. Most of the time goes into the filter soak, which cannot be hurried. If the kitchen has not been cleaned in over a year, expect the upper end of that range rather than the lower.`},{q:`Is the chimney filter cleaning included in the price?`,a:`Yes. Dismantling the chimney filter, soaking it in degreaser, scrubbing it and refitting it is part of every standard kitchen deep clean from ₹1,500. The mesh, the grease tray and the duct cover are all handled on site. If the filter needs chemical replacement or the motor is faulty, that is quoted separately.`},{q:`Gurgaon me kitchen deep cleaning kitne ka hai?`,a:`Standard kitchen deep cleaning ₹1,500 se ₹2,500 ke beech me hoti hai, aur badi ya island kitchen ₹2,500–₹3,500 tak. Chimney filter cleaning isme shamil hai, koi alag charge nahi. Oven interior ke liye ₹400 extra lagta hai. Time 3 se 4 ghante ka hota hai.`},{q:`Do you clean the inside of kitchen cabinets and the fridge?`,a:`Cabinet interiors are always cleaned — shelves, corners and the underside of the chimney, because that is where most of the oil sits. The fridge interior is a separate job at ₹500, since it needs the shelves pulled out, washed and dried before the fridge is plugged back in. We empty it only if you have already done so.`},{q:`How often should a kitchen be deep cleaned in Gurgaon?`,a:`Every six to nine months for a working kitchen, and every four months if you fry daily or have an open kitchen facing the road. Between deep cleans, wiping the hob and hob ledge after use keeps the grease from hardening on glass. Gurgaon kitchens collect cooking mist and road dust faster than most, so the range stays short.`},{q:`How much extra does a kitchen with heavy baked-on grease cost?`,a:`A heavily greased kitchen usually runs ₹2,500–₹3,500 instead of the standard ₹1,500, because built-on carbon needs a longer soak and a second degreaser pass. The price is quoted after we see the hob, hood and chimney filter on a call or a photo. We never bill by the hour on kitchen jobs, so the figure holds once quoted.`}],factors:{title:`What changes the final price`,items:[`Kitchen size — standard, large or island layout`,`How long the kitchen has gone without a deep clean`,`Number of cabinets and the amount of internal storage`,`Condition of the built-in oven, microwave and chimney filter`,`Grease and burnt residue on hob, tiles and grout joints`,`Add-ons such as fridge interiors or exhaust duct cleaning`]}},bathroom:{priceTable:{title:`Bathroom Deep Cleaning Charges in Gurgaon`,note:`Our published bathroom rate card — the exact figure is confirmed on the call before the team starts.`,head:[`Service`,`Charges`,`Time per bathroom`,`What it covers`],rows:[[`Single bathroom deep clean`,`₹800`,`45–60 minutes`,`Tiles, taps, commode and mirror`],[`Two bathrooms`,`₹1,600`,`1.5–2 hours`,`Both descaled and sanitised`],[`Three bathrooms`,`₹2,400`,`2–3 hours`,`Adds floor scrub and drain clearing`],[`Hard-water descaling`,`Included`,`15–20 minutes`,`Taps, shower panels and glass`],[`Grout scrub and black-stain removal`,`Included`,`20–30 minutes`,`Tile joints, corners and drains`],[`Mould and damp patch treatment`,`Add ₹300`,`20–30 minutes`,`Silicone joints and under-sink areas`]]},qa:[{q:`How much does bathroom deep cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`A single bathroom deep clean costs ₹800 in Gurgaon, two bathrooms cost ₹1,600 and three cost ₹2,400. Descaling taps and shower glass, scrubbing grout, cleaning the commode and polishing the mirror are all inside that per-bathroom figure. A separate mould and damp patch treatment is ₹300 extra per bathroom.`},{q:`How long does one bathroom take to deep clean?`,a:`Forty-five to sixty minutes for a standard bathroom. That covers descaling the taps, shower panel and glass, scrubbing the tile grout, cleaning and sanitising the commode, wiping the mirror and fittings, and scrubbing the floor and drain. A badly scaled or mould-heavy bathroom runs towards the sixty-minute mark.`},{q:`Can you remove hard-water stains and limescale from bathroom tiles?`,a:`Yes. Gurgaon water carries roughly 800–1,200 mg/L of dissolved solids, and that limescale bonds to the tile glaze within weeks. We apply a professional descaler, let it work for five to ten minutes, then scrub and rinse, so the tile returns to its original colour. A wipe with vinegar on its own will not shift it.`},{q:`What is included in a bathroom deep cleaning service?`,a:`Tile and floor scrubbing, tap and shower fitting descaling, glass partition cleaning, commode and flush sanitisation, mirror polishing, drain clearing, cobweb removal, and a wipe-down of every touch point including the flush lever and door handle. High-touch surfaces are disinfected, not just wiped, at the end of the visit.`},{q:`Gurgaon me bathroom deep cleaning ka kharcha kya hai?`,a:`Ek bathroom ki deep cleaning ₹800 hoti hai, do bathrooms ₹1,600 aur teen ₹2,400. Isme tiles, taps, shower glass, commode, mirror aur drain ka descaling shaamil hai. Mould ya damp patch ke liye ₹300 extra lagta hai. Ek bathroom me 45 se 60 minutes lagte hain.`},{q:`How much extra does mould removal cost in a bathroom?`,a:`Mould and damp patch treatment costs ₹300 extra per bathroom and takes another twenty to thirty minutes. We treat the affected silicone joints, the under-sink area and the corners where damp collects, then run a disinfectant pass over the whole bathroom. Sealed joints that are already crumbling need replacing, which is quoted separately.`},{q:`Do you disinfect the bathroom or only wipe it down?`,a:`We disinfect. Wiping removes loose dirt; disinfecting kills the bacteria and fungus that live on the flush handle, door handle, tap knobs and seat hinges. Every bathroom deep clean ends with a hospital-grade disinfectant pass on those touch points and a fogged-solution treatment on the tiles, which is why the standard ₹800 package covers it.`},{q:`How much does it cost to clean two bathrooms together?`,a:`Two bathrooms cleaned together cost ₹1,600, which works out to ₹800 for each one and saves a second trip for the setup. Both are fully descaled, grout-scrubbed and sanitised in about one and a half to two hours. The per-bathroom rate holds whether you book one, two or three, so there is no penalty for having more.`}],factors:{title:`What changes the final price`,items:[`Number of bathrooms — priced per bathroom, not per flat`,`Hard-water scale thickness on taps, tiles and glass`,`Mould and damp patches that need separate treatment`,`Fixture count — vanities, storage units and fittings`,`Condition of the grout and whether joints are crumbling`,`Add-ons such as deep drain clearing or tile re-grouting`]}},sofa:{priceTable:{title:`Sofa Shampoo Cleaning Charges in Gurgaon — Per Seat`,note:`Our published per-seat sofa cleaning rates — the final figure is confirmed on the call after checking the fabric type.`,head:[`Sofa option`,`Charges`,`Method`,`Drying time`],rows:[[`Dry cleaning, per seat`,`₹499`,`Vacuum and spot treatment`,`No drying wait`],[`Shampoo extraction, per seat`,`₹599`,`Hot-water extraction`,`4–6 hours`],[`Standard 3-seater sofa`,`₹1,500–₹1,800`,`Full extraction on both cushions`,`4–6 hours`],[`Corner sofa, 5–6 seater`,`₹2,200–₹2,800`,`Full extraction, all sections`,`6–8 hours`],[`Recliner or office chair`,`₹199`,`Hot-water extraction`,`2–3 hours`],[`Stain and odour treatment`,`Included`,`Pre-treatment spray`,`Part of the job`],[`Fabric protection spray`,`Add ₹150`,`Applied after drying`,`Lasts 6–12 months`]]},qa:[{q:`How much does sofa cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`Sofa cleaning in Gurgaon costs ₹499 per seat for dry cleaning and ₹599 per seat for hot-water shampoo extraction. A standard 3-seater sofa comes to ₹1,500–₹1,800, and a corner 5–6 seater runs ₹2,200–₹2,800. Stain and odour treatment is included in every seat price, and a recliner is ₹199.`},{q:`What is the price difference between dry cleaning and shampoo cleaning a sofa?`,a:`Dry cleaning is a deep vacuum with a spot treatment spray, which lifts loose dust but leaves ground-in soil inside the foam. Shampoo cleaning pushes heated shampoo into the fabric and pulls it back out with the dirt, for ₹599 a seat against ₹499 for dry cleaning. Shampoo needs four to six hours of drying.`},{q:`How long does a sofa take to dry after shampoo cleaning?`,a:`Four to six hours for a standard sofa, and six to eight hours for a corner unit or a thickly padded one. We use low-moisture extraction and place air movers where the sofa sits, so it is usually ready to sit on by evening and fully usable the next morning. Covering it while drying helps, but is not required.`},{q:`How much does a 3-seater sofa cleaning cost?`,a:`A standard 3-seater sofa costs ₹1,500–₹1,800 to shampoo in Gurgaon, which works out to ₹500–₹600 per seat. The price holds for sofas with three seat cushions and two back cushions. Corner units with fixed panels or extra chaise sections are quoted individually, and a fabric protection spray adds ₹150.`},{q:`Sofa cleaning ke baad use kab kar sakte hain?`,a:`Shampoo cleaning ke baad sofa ko 4 se 6 ghante use na karein — wet upholstery par nishan pad jaate hain aur shape bigad sakti hai. Dry cleaning me aisa nahi hota, wahan turant use kar sakte hain. Puri tarah sukha hone ke baad sofa ek din me normal jaisa lagta hai.`},{q:`Is sofa shampoo cleaning safe for fabric and leather?`,a:`Yes, provided the right method is matched to the material. Cotton, linen, wool, nylon and polyester are shampooed with hot-water extraction after a colour-fastness test on a hidden patch. Leather and rexine are not shampooed at all — they are cleaned with a pH-neutral leather cleaner and conditioned afterwards to stop cracking.`},{q:`Can you remove stains and pet odour from a sofa?`,a:`Yes. Spills, oil marks, ink and pet urine are pre-treated individually before extraction, and odour is neutralised rather than masked. Deep-set urine staining in foam sometimes leaves a shadow even after a full shampoo, and we tell you that on the call. Every sofa job ends with a deodorising pass, included in the per-seat price.`}],factors:{title:`What changes the final price`,items:[`Number of seats — the primary pricing unit for every sofa`,`Fabric type — velvet, suede and leather need other methods`,`Soil level and how long the stains have been set`,`Fixed panels, chaise sections and recliner mechanisms on the sofa`,`Pet urine or oil staining needing separate pre-treatment`,`Add-ons such as fabric protection spray or mattress cleaning`]}},carpet:{priceTable:{title:`Carpet Shampoo Cleaning Rates in Gurgaon — Per Square Foot`,note:`Our published carpet rate card — the exact figure is confirmed on the call once we know the carpet size and fibre.`,head:[`Carpet option`,`Rate`,`Example cost`,`Drying time`],rows:[[`Dry cleaning`,`₹15 per sq ft`,`100 sq ft = ₹1,500`,`2–4 hours`],[`Shampoo extraction`,`₹18 per sq ft`,`100 sq ft = ₹1,800`,`6–8 hours`],[`Stain and spill treatment`,`Included`,`No extra charge`,`Part of the job`],[`Allergen and mite treatment`,`Included`,`No extra charge`,`Part of the job`],[`Area rug, per piece`,`From ₹600`,`6 × 4 ft rug`,`4–6 hours`],[`Wool or silk rug`,`Quoted on site`,`Needs a fibre check`,`6–10 hours`]]},qa:[{q:`How much does carpet cleaning cost per square foot in Gurgaon?`,a:`Carpet cleaning in Gurgaon costs ₹18 per square foot for shampoo extraction and ₹15 per square foot for dry cleaning. A 100 sq ft carpet therefore comes to ₹1,800 for shampoo or ₹1,500 for dry cleaning. Stain treatment and allergen removal are included in both rates, and area rugs start at ₹600 per piece.`},{q:`How long does a carpet take to dry after shampoo cleaning?`,a:`Six to eight hours for a shampooed carpet, and two to four hours for a dry-cleaned one. We run air movers across the carpet while we work and leave them running afterwards, which pulls moisture out of the pile. A room with good ventilation and fans dries faster, and heavy furniture should stay off the carpet until it is dry.`},{q:`Is carpet shampoo cleaning worth the price compared with vacuuming?`,a:`Vacuuming lifts surface dust; it does not remove the soil, hair and allergens embedded in the pile. A shampoo extraction flushes that dirt out with hot water and detergent, which is why carpets visibly brighten and allergies ease afterwards. Vacuum twice a week between services and the extraction interval can stretch to nine or twelve months.`},{q:`What is included in a carpet shampoo cleaning service?`,a:`A carpet shampoo clean includes a dry pass to lift loose soil, pre-treatment of every stain and spill, hot-water extraction of the whole area, a rinse pass, and a sanitising treatment against allergens and dust mites. Furniture is shifted and replaced afterwards, and edge and corner lines receive an extra pass by hand.`},{q:`Gurgaon me carpet cleaning ka rate kya hai?`,a:`Carpet cleaning ₹15 per sq ft dry cleaning aur ₹18 per sq ft shampoo extraction me hoti hai. 10×12 ft carpet ke liye ₹1,800–₹2,160 lagta hai. Stain treatment aur allergy removal included hai. Drying time shampoo ke baad 6 se 8 ghante lagti hai.`},{q:`Can you remove stains and pet hair from a carpet?`,a:`Yes. Fresh spills, oil, ink and pet urine are pre-treated before extraction, and pet hair is lifted with a high-suction pass and rubber brush. Urine odour is neutralised at the padding layer, not just the surface. A stain that has bonded to the backing over a long period may not lift fully, and we say so before starting.`},{q:`Do you move furniture for wall-to-wall carpet cleaning?`,a:`Light furniture — coffee tables, chairs, floor lamps and planters — is shifted and put back as part of the job. Heavy items like beds, wardrobes and dining units are cleaned around unless you arrange for them to be moved. Tell us on the booking call and we plan the crew size and machine path around them.`}],factors:{title:`What changes the final price`,items:[`Measured carpet area — every rate is per square foot`,`Fibre type — wool and silk need gentler, slower treatment`,`Pile length and how deeply the soil has settled`,`Number and age of the stains needing pre-treatment`,`Number of rooms and how many machine shifts are needed`,`Furniture to be shifted, moved back and cleaned around`]}},office:{priceTable:{title:`Office Deep Cleaning Charges in Gurgaon`,note:`Our published commercial rate card — the final figure is confirmed after a free site survey of your floor.`,head:[`Office size`,`Charges`,`How it is measured`,`Timing`],rows:[[`Small office, under 1,000 sq ft`,`From ₹5,000`,`Fixed scope, nine areas`,`After hours or weekends`],[`Rate per square foot`,`₹3 per sq ft`,`Survey-quoted by area`,`Night shifts available`],[`2,000 sq ft floor`,`About ₹6,000`,`Survey-quoted by area`,`Night shifts available`],[`5,000 sq ft floor`,`About ₹15,000`,`Survey-quoted by area`,`Split across two visits`],[`Showroom or retail shop`,`From ₹5,000`,`Floor plus display areas`,`Before opening hours`],[`Recurring monthly contract`,`Quoted on site`,`Scope locked in writing`,`Fixed weekly or monthly slot`]]},qa:[{q:`How much does office deep cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`Office deep cleaning in Gurgaon starts at ₹5,000 for a small office under 1,000 sq ft, and is otherwise quoted at ₹3 per square foot after a site survey. A 2,000 sq ft floor comes to about ₹6,000 and a 5,000 sq ft floor about ₹15,000. GST invoices with scope lines are available for every business booking.`},{q:`How is office cleaning priced — per square foot or fixed?`,a:`Small offices under 1,000 sq ft are priced as a fixed package from ₹5,000 covering nine defined areas. Larger floors are quoted at ₹3 per square foot once we have surveyed the layout, so the figure reflects actual workstations, washroom count and carpet area rather than a headcount. Either way, the quote is written down before the work starts.`},{q:`What areas are covered in an office deep clean?`,a:`Nine areas: workstations, pantry, washrooms, carpets or tile floors, glass partitions, reception and lobby, conference rooms and cabins, AC vents with high dusting, and bin sanitising. Showrooms and clinics get their own scope — retail display areas and clinic-grade washroom protocols are added on request.`},{q:`Can office cleaning be done after working hours?`,a:`Yes. After-hours, early-morning and weekend slots are our most requested options, because a floor keeps working while the clean happens. For a 2,000 sq ft floor the work usually runs from 9 pm to 4 am, and we position machines and cables so the space is usable again by morning. Recurring contracts fix the slot permanently.`},{q:`Office cleaning ka rate kya hota hai?`,a:`Office deep cleaning ₹5,000 se shuru hoti hai chhoti office ke liye, aur badi floors ke liye ₹3 per sq ft survey ke baad. 2,000 sq ft floor ka kharcha about ₹6,000 aata hai. Workstations, pantry, washroom, carpet aur glass sab included hai. After-hours slot available hai.`},{q:`Do you clean workstations, keyboards and monitors?`,a:`Yes, and that is the part most office cleaners skip. We clean desks, keyboards, mouse surfaces, monitors, chair frames, partitions and the underside of workstations with an electronics-safe method that does not spray liquid into any device. Server zones are handled with dry anti-static methods, coordinated with your IT team.`},{q:`How often should an office in Gurgaon be deep cleaned?`,a:`Every quarter for most workplaces, and monthly for clinics, restaurants, salons and coworking floors with heavy footfall. Quarterly deep cleans reset workstations, washrooms, carpets and vents, while a weekly or fortnightly housekeeping visit handles bins, washroom consumables and floor care in between. We can hold both under one agreement.`}],factors:{title:`What changes the final price`,items:[`Carpeted or tiled floor area — the main measurable input`,`Number of workstations, cabins and separate meeting rooms`,`Washroom count and whether touch points need disinfection`,`Condition of the floors — food, smoke or construction dust`,`Special scopes such as clinics, kitchens or server rooms`,`Timing — night and weekend slots carry a crew premium`]}},move:{priceTable:{title:`Move-In and Move-Out Cleaning Charges in Gurgaon`,note:`Our published empty-flat rate card — the exact figure is confirmed on the call before the handover date.`,head:[`Home size`,`Charges`,`Time on site`,`What it covers`],rows:[[`1 RK / studio`,`From ₹1,999`,`3–4 hours`,`Empty-flat handover clean`],[`1 BHK`,`₹3,000–₹3,500`,`4–5 hours`,`Kitchen, bathroom, rooms and floors`],[`2 BHK`,`₹4,000–₹5,500`,`6–7 hours`,`Two bathrooms fully descaled`],[`3 BHK`,`₹5,500–₹6,500`,`8–9 hours`,`Wardrobes, balconies and vents`],[`4 BHK or villa`,`From ₹6,500`,`9–12 hours`,`Terrace and marble-safe products`],[`Add-on: paint and adhesive removal`,`Add ₹500–₹800`,`Extra 1 hour`,`Skirting and window frames`]]},qa:[{q:`How much does move-in move-out cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`Move-in and move-out cleaning in Gurgaon starts at ₹1,999 for a studio. A 1 BHK is ₹3,000–₹3,500, a 2 BHK ₹4,000–₹5,500 and a 3 BHK ₹5,500–₹6,500, with a 4 BHK or villa from ₹6,500. Every quote is for an empty flat and is locked on the call before the handover date.`},{q:`What is included in a move-out cleaning service?`,a:`An empty flat is cleaned inside every cupboard, wardrobe and kitchen cabinet, the bathroom and kitchen are fully descaled and degreased, floors and skirting are scrubbed, windows and sills are wiped, and the whole space is vacuumed and mopped. The result is a handover-ready flat with a ticked room checklist for the landlord.`},{q:`How long does move-in move-out cleaning take?`,a:`Three to twelve hours depending on size. A studio takes 3–4 hours, a 1 BHK 4–5 hours, a 2 BHK 6–7 hours and a 3 BHK 8–9 hours. A 4 BHK or villa runs 9–12 hours with a larger crew. Book it the day before the handover so the flat is dry and ready for the key check.`},{q:`Does a professional move-out clean improve my chances of recovering the deposit, and what does it cost?`,a:`Yes, and the cost is ₹3,000–₹5,500 for a 2 BHK empty flat. Landlords check the kitchen, bathroom, floors and walls before releasing the deposit, and those are exactly the areas a handover clean scrubs properly. You also get a photo record of the finished flat for your own file. The price is locked on the call.`},{q:`Move-in move-out cleaning ka kharcha kitna hai?`,a:`Move-in aur move-out cleaning ₹1,999 se shuru hoti hai. 2 BHK empty flat ke liye ₹4,000–₹5,500 lagta hai, 1 BHK ₹3,000–₹3,500 aur 3 BHK ₹5,500–₹6,500. Flat size ke hisaab se price fix ho jati hai aur call par lock ho jati hai.`},{q:`Do you clean an empty flat or a furnished one, and what does each cost?`,a:`An empty flat is our standard move-in and move-out package, and a 2 BHK costs ₹4,000–₹5,500 that way. A furnished flat needs a separate quote because sofas, beds and dining units add shifting and detail time, usually ₹1,000–₹2,000 more. Tell us what is still in the flat on the call.`},{q:`Do you clean cupboards and appliances inside during a handover clean?`,a:`Yes, empty cupboards, wardrobe interiors, kitchen cabinets, fridge shelves and the inside of washing machine and microwave are all wiped out. We do not move or reinstall fixed appliances, and we leave them dry. Add-on paint and adhesive removal from skirting and window frames is ₹500–₹800 extra.`}],factors:{title:`What changes the final price`,items:[`Flat size — from ₹1,999 for a studio to ₹6,500 for a villa`,`Whether the flat is empty or still partly furnished`,`Number of bathrooms, each needing a full descale`,`Paint, adhesive or cement marks left after a renovation`,`Access — lift availability and the floor the flat sits on`,`Handover date and slot, including evening and weekend slots`]}},fullhome:{priceTable:{title:`Full Home Deep Cleaning Charges by BHK in Gurgaon`,note:`Our published BHK card — the exact figure for your flat is confirmed on the call before the booking is made. Typical crew shown; larger or dirtier homes may need more.`,head:[`BHK`,`Charges`,`Area covered`,`Time on site`],rows:[[`1 BHK`,`₹2,500`,`400–600 sq ft`,`4–5 hours, 2 cleaners`],[`2 BHK`,`₹4,500`,`601–1,000 sq ft`,`5–6 hours, 2–3 cleaners`],[`3 BHK`,`₹5,500`,`1,001–1,500 sq ft`,`6–7 hours, 3–4 cleaners`],[`4 BHK`,`₹6,500`,`1,501–2,100 sq ft`,`7–8 hours, 4–5 cleaners`],[`5 BHK / villa`,`₹9,000`,`2,500–3,000 sq ft`,`8–9 hours, 5 cleaners`],[`Per square foot equivalent`,`₹3–₹6 per sq ft`,`Any built-up size`,`Scales with the area`],[`Furnished home`,`Add ₹500–₹1,500`,`Sofa and dining units`,`Adds 1–2 hours`]]},qa:[{key:`bhkCost`,q:`How much does full home deep cleaning cost for a 2 BHK in Gurgaon?`,a:`A 2 BHK full home deep clean in Gurgaon costs ₹4,500 for a non-furnished flat, covering 601–1,000 sq ft over 5–6 hours with two to three cleaners. Furnished 2 BHKs with a sofa, dining table and extra wardrobes run ₹5,000–₹5,500. The price includes machines, products, travel and the final walkthrough.`},{key:`bhkTime`,q:`How long does a 3 BHK full home deep clean take?`,a:`Six to seven hours, with three to four cleaners on site. That is enough time for three bedrooms and their wardrobes, two or three bathrooms fully descaled, a modular kitchen with the chimney filter dismantled and soaked, AC vent covers opened and dusted, and every ceiling fan wiped blade by blade. A furnished 3 BHK adds one to two hours.`},{q:`Which BHK deep cleaning package should I book for my flat?`,a:`Book the package that matches your carpet area, not your bedroom count. A 1 BHK at 400–600 sq ft is ₹2,500, a 2 BHK at 601–1,000 sq ft is ₹4,500 and a 3 BHK at 1,001–1,500 sq ft is ₹5,500. Larger apartments with two or three bathrooms and a bigger kitchen should go a step up for crew time.`},{q:`What is the difference between full home deep cleaning and room-by-room cleaning?`,a:`Full home deep cleaning is one scheduled crew working through every room in sequence, with shared setup and a single walkthrough at the end. Booking rooms separately costs more and leaves gaps, because the same prep and finish time is repeated for each. A 2 BHK done room by room usually costs ₹5,500–₹6,500 against ₹4,500 as one package.`},{q:`Full home deep cleaning ka rate kitna hai Gurgaon me?`,a:`Full home deep cleaning 1 BHK ₹2,500, 2 BHK ₹4,500, 3 BHK ₹5,500, 4 BHK ₹6,500 aur 5 BHK villa ₹9,000. 1 RK ke liye ₹2,000. Time 1 BHK me 5–6 ghante aur villa me 10–12 ghante lagta hai. Per square foot ₹3 se ₹6 rate hai.`},{q:`Is sofa shampoo included in a full home deep clean?`,a:`Not as a full shampoo. Every full home deep clean includes a deep vacuum and spot pre-treatment of sofas, and full hot-water extraction is an add-on at ₹499 per seat for dry and ₹599 for shampoo. Most customers add the sofa to the same visit, because the team is already on site and the cost is lower.`},{q:`How do you calculate deep cleaning cost per square foot?`,a:`The published rate is ₹3–₹6 per square foot depending on size and finish, and the BHK packages are the fixed equivalents. A 1 BHK of roughly 450 sq ft at ₹2,500 works out near ₹5 per sq ft, while a 3 BHK of about 1,250 sq ft at ₹5,500 lands a little over ₹4 per sq ft. We quote the package, not the arithmetic.`}],factors:{title:`What changes the final price`,items:[`Carpet area, which is the number the BHK packages are built on`,`Number of bathrooms, since each one needs a full descale`,`Furnishing level, including sofa, dining units and wardrobes`,`Floor finish — marble and wood need gentler products`,`Balcony and terrace size, plus difficult access to vents`,`Add-ons such as sofa shampoo, carpet extraction or windows`]}},watertank:{priceTable:{title:`Water Tank Cleaning Charges in Gurgaon`,note:`Published rates per tank. The exact figure is confirmed on the call, before the crew is dispatched.`,head:[`Tank type`,`Charges`,`Time on site`,`Notes`],rows:[[`Overhead tank (up to 1,000 L)`,`₹399`,`60–90 min`,`Scrub, descale, disinfect, rinse`],[`Overhead tank (1,000–2,500 L)`,`₹599`,`90–120 min`,`Scale and biofilm removal`],[`Underground tank`,`₹999`,`2–4 hrs`,`Crew entry kit, debris wash, disinfection`],[`Two tanks (overhead + underground)`,`₹1,299`,`3–4 hrs`,`Both tanks in one visit`],[`Society overhead + underground (per society)`,`From ₹1,499`,`Half day`,`Tower-level booking, RWA invoice`],[`Add-on: tank lid and pipe seal check`,`Free`,`Included`,`Crack and seepage flagged on the tick sheet`],[`Add-on: overhead tank insulation jacket`,`₹299`,`20 min`,`Optional, quoted only if requested`]]},qa:[{q:`How much does water tank cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`Water tank cleaning in Gurgaon costs ₹399 for an overhead tank up to 1,000 litres, ₹599 for 1,000–2,500 litres, and ₹999 for an underground tank. A combined overhead-plus-underground visit is ₹1,299. Prices are fixed on the call before the visit, with nothing added on site.`},{q:`How often should a water tank be cleaned in Gurgaon?`,a:`Every six months for an overhead tank and every twelve months for an underground tank. Gurgaon runs on borewell and municipal mixes, so the TDS loads tanks faster than in softer-water cities. Societies on a single borewell should book a tower-level clean twice a year.`},{q:`Is overhead water tank cleaning worth it if the water looks clear?`,a:`Yes. Biofilm and scale build on the tank walls long before the water looks dusty, and that film is what carries the smell and the bacteria. A clean tank removes the biofilm layer, not just the visible silt — which is why a ₹399 clean every six months beats a repeat of the ₹999 deep clean.`},{q:`Can you clean an underground water tank in Gurgaon?`,a:`Yes. Underground tank cleaning in Gurgaon is ₹999 for a 2–4 hour visit and needs a two-person crew with entry kit. We scrub the walls and floor, wash out the debris, disinfect with a safe contact-time dose, then hand over with a visible water-level check on the tick sheet.`},{q:`Do you clean society water tanks for RWAs in Gurgaon?`,a:`Yes — society tanks are cleaned at tower level, from ₹1,499 per society for an overhead-plus-underground pair. We book within a scheduled RWA window, carry our own entry kit, issue a GST invoice, and hand over a per-tank tick sheet the RWA can file.`},{q:`What is the difference between a ₹399 tank clean and a ₹999 one?`,a:`The difference is the tank and the entry. A ₹399 clean is an overhead tank the crew reaches from a ladder with a brush and a hose. The ₹999 visit is an underground tank that needs entry kit, debris removal, wall scrubbing at floor level, and a longer disinfectant contact time before the rinse.`},{q:`Gurgaon me water tank cleaning ka kharcha kitna padta hai?`,a:`Overhead tank cleaning ₹399 se shuru hoti hai, 1,000–2,500 litre ke tank me ₹599 lagta hai, aur underground tank ₹999 hota hai. Dono tank ke liye ek visit ₹1,999 me ho jaati hai. Price call par fix ho jati hai, site par kuch extra nahi.`}],factors:{title:`What changes the water tank cleaning price`,items:[`Tank size — capacity in litres changes crew time and chemical dose`,`Tank type — overhead tanks are reachable, underground tanks need entry kit`,`Scale and biofilm load — a tank that has not been cleaned in two years takes longer`,`Access — terrace height, hatch size and whether a second crew member is needed`,`Society booking — a tower-level clean is priced per society, not per flat`,`Add-ons — insulation jackets and pipe fittings are billed only when requested`]}},toilettank:{priceTable:{title:`Toilet Tank Cleaning Charges in Gurgaon`,note:`Fixed per-tank pricing, confirmed on the call. No hidden charges on the day.`,head:[`Job`,`Charges`,`Time on site`,`Notes`],rows:[[`Toilet tank clean (flush tank, seat, hinges)`,`₹499`,`45–60 min`,`Interior scrub, descale, disinfection`],[`Toilet tank + commode interior deep clean`,`₹699`,`60–90 min`,`Jet channel and bowl underside included`],[`Toilet tank + floor and skirting descale`,`₹899`,`90 min`,`Hard-water scale on tiles and edges`],[`Two toilets (both tanks)`,`₹899`,`90 min`,`Second tank at ₹400`],[`Three toilets (all tanks)`,`₹1,299`,`2–2.5 hrs`,`Third tank at ₹400`],[`Move-in / move-out toilet reset`,`Included in full-home`,`—`,`Part of the handover checklist`]]},qa:[{q:`How much does toilet tank cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`Toilet tank cleaning in Gurgaon costs ₹499 per tank — the flush tank interior, seat, hinges and flush lever. A tank plus a commode interior deep clean is ₹699, and two tanks are ₹899. The price is confirmed on the call and never revised on site.`},{q:`Why does my toilet tank smell even after cleaning it?`,a:`Because the smell sits inside the flush tank, not the bowl. Mineral scale, rust from the fittings and a biofilm layer hold odour that a bowl brush never reaches. A ₹499 tank clean opens the tank, scrubs and descales the interior and disinfects before reassembly.`},{q:`Do you dismantle the flush mechanism to clean the tank?`,a:`Yes. The tank lid comes off, the flush mechanism is lifted, and the tank interior is scrubbed and descaled with a safe contact-time disinfectant. Parts that are cracked or leaking are shown to you and logged on the tick sheet rather than replaced without approval.`},{q:`Can I book a toilet tank clean on its own, or must it be part of a bathroom clean?`,a:`You can book it on its own. A standalone tank clean is ₹499 and takes 45–60 minutes — useful when the bowl is fine but the odour and yellow scale inside the tank keep returning. If the grout and tiles also need attention, the full bathroom deep clean at ₹800 is better value.`},{q:`Is toilet tank cleaning safe for kids and pets?`,a:`Yes. We use non-toxic, pet-safe cleaners with no harsh chemical residue, and the flush mechanism is reassembled and flushed before we hand over. There is no strong smell lingering, and the toilet is usable as soon as we leave.`},{q:`Do you clean toilet tanks in societies, or only independent flats?`,a:`Both. We clean toilet tanks in flats, builder floors and society bathrooms. For a society common bathroom, the same ₹499 per tank applies and an RWA invoice is issued on request — confirm the number of tanks on the call so the crew carries the right time slot.`},{q:`Gurgaon me toilet tank cleaning ka rate kya hai?`,a:`Ek tank ₹499 hota hai, jismein flush tank ke andar ki safai, seat, hinge aur flush lever ki safai shamil hai. Do tank ₹899 lagte hain. Commode ke andar ki deep clean ke saath ₹699 hota hai. Price call par lock ho jaati hai.`}],factors:{title:`What changes the toilet tank cleaning price`,items:[`Number of tanks — the second and third tanks are billed at ₹400 each`,`Commode interior — a jet-channel and bowl-underside deep clean adds ₹200`,`Scale load — hard-water belts need a longer descaler contact time`,`Floor and skirting — bathroom tiles and edges are a separate line item`,`Access type — society common bathrooms need an RWA slot`,`Part condition — cracked or leaking fittings are flagged, never replaced silently`]}},facade:{priceTable:{title:`Window & Facade Cleaning Charges in Gurgaon`,note:`Quoted per square foot of glass and facade surface. The exact figure is confirmed after a look at the photos on WhatsApp.`,head:[`Surface`,`Charges`,`Time on site`,`Notes`],rows:[[`External facade glass`,`From ₹3 per sq ft`,`Scales with area`,`Squeegee finish, no runs`],[`External + internal glass`,`From ₹4 per sq ft`,`Adds 50% time`,`Both panes, frames and tracks`],[`Window frames, tracks and sills`,`₹149 per window`,`20–30 min`,`Grit removal from the track channel`],[`Balcony facade and glass railing`,`₹299 per balcony`,`45–60 min`,`Handrail and glass panel wipe`],[`Commercial facade (10,000+ sq ft)`,`Survey-quoted`,`Night or weekend`,`Rope-access advised above 3 floors`],[`Add-on: hard-water stain treatment`,`₹99 per panel`,`15 min`,`Scale etch on Gurgaon-borewell floors`]]},qa:[{q:`How much does window cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`Window cleaning in Gurgaon starts at ₹149 per window for frames, tracks and sills. Facade glass is quoted from ₹3 per sq ft for the external face, and from ₹4 per sq ft when both panes, frames and tracks are included. Send photos on WhatsApp for a figure before the crew moves.`},{q:`Can you clean the outside of high-floor windows in Gurgaon?`,a:`For floors up to three we work from inside with an extension pole and a squeegee. Above three floors we advise rope-access, which we arrange as a survey-quoted job rather than improvising a ladder on a balcony. The quote separates our glass work from the access crew.`},{q:`Do you clean window tracks and sills, or just the glass?`,a:`Both. The track channel is the part that grinds the glass the first time a window slides, so we vacuum the grit out, wipe the channel, and polish the pane. A window clean in Gurgaon at ₹149 covers the frame, the track, the sill and the glass, not just the pane.`},{q:`How do you remove hard-water scale from Gurgaon window glass?`,a:`With a mild acid descaler and a dwell time, then a squeegee finish. Fresh scale lifts in one pass; year-old etch on borewell-fed flats lightens rather than disappears, and we tell you that on the walkthrough before you pay. It is ₹99 per panel and always optional.`},{q:`Can I book a facade clean for my shop or office in Gurgaon?`,a:`Yes. Commercial facades from 10,000 sq ft are survey-quoted and scheduled at night or on a weekend so no workday is lost. We issue a GST invoice and a per-zone photo log, and we advise rope-access rather than improvising above the third floor.`},{q:`Is exterior window cleaning worth it before Diwali?`,a:`Yes, and it is the single highest-visibility ₹999 you can spend before Diwali. Glass carries the festive look, and Gurgaon construction dust films it within weeks. Book the facade clean before the full-home clean so the final walk-through shows the glass, not the dust the crew just moved.`},{q:`Gurgaon me window cleaning ka kharcha kitna hota hai?`,a:`Ek window ke frame, track aur glass ki safai ₹149 hoti hai. Facade glass external side ₹3 per sq ft se shuru hoti hai, dono side ke liye ₹4 per sq ft. Photos WhatsApp par bhejein, price call par fix mil jaayega.`}],factors:{title:`What changes the window and facade cleaning price`,items:[`Glass area — the per-sq-ft rate scales, so a 20-panel flat and a villa gap is large`,`One side or both — internal work adds roughly half the time again`,`Floor height — above three floors we advise rope-access, quoted separately`,`Scale condition — borewell-fed floors need a descaler pass at ₹99 per panel`,`Balconies and railings — each is a separate ₹299 line, not folded into the glass`,`Commercial vs residential — a GST invoice and a photo log are standard on commercial`]}},commonarea:{priceTable:{title:`Common Area Cleaning Charges in Gurgaon`,note:`Per-visit pricing for societies, towers and commercial common blocks. RWA invoices issued on completion.`,head:[`Area`,`Charges`,`Time on site`,`Notes`],rows:[[`Lobby, lift lobby and reception`,`₹499`,`60–90 min`,`Glass, floor, front desk and seating`],[`Staircase and corridor (per floor)`,`₹299`,`30–45 min`,`Steps, railing, cobweb and window track`],[`Parking apron and podium edge`,`₹799`,`2 hrs`,`Pressure wash, drain-edge and glass balustrade`],[`Clubhouse and gym common block`,`From ₹999`,`2–3 hrs`,`Floor, glass and high-touch points`],[`Full tower common area (RWA visit)`,`From ₹2,499`,`Half day`,`Lobby, stairs, lift lobby, apron and clubhouse`],[`Add-on: RWA gate-pass handling`,`Included`,`—`,`We carry IDs and pre-share crew names`]]},qa:[{q:`How much does common area cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`Common area cleaning in Gurgaon is ₹499 for a lobby and lift lobby visit, ₹299 per floor for a staircase and corridor, ₹799 for a parking apron, and ₹2,499 for a full tower visit. RWA bookings are invoiced with GST and a per-zone tick sheet on completion.`},{q:`Can an RWA book a single tower clean, or do they need the whole society?`,a:`A single tower is fine and is often the better start. One tower common-area clean is ₹2,499 for a half-day visit covering lobby, stairs, lift lobby, apron and clubhouse. We pre-share crew names for the gate pass, work inside the RWA window, and hand over a tick sheet you can file.`},{q:`Do you clean society parking aprons and podiums in Gurgaon?`,a:`Yes — aprons and podium edges are pressure-washed at ₹799 for a two-hour visit. Drain edges and glass balustrades are included, and we flag blocked drains on the tick sheet rather than clearing them, which is a separate trade.`},{q:`How do you schedule around a society that is always occupied?`,a:`We book the RWA window you set, split the work zone by zone, and carry our own entry kit and IDs. Lobby work happens before the morning peak and apron work after the evening one, so residents are never blocked. The same ₹499 lobby rate applies either way.`},{q:`What is included in a tower common-area clean?`,a:`A half-day tower visit covers the lobby and reception, every lift lobby, staircases and corridors, the parking apron edge and the clubhouse common block. Glass, floors, railing, high-touch points and cobwebs are in scope. Repairs, plumbing and drain clearing are not, and are listed as exceptions.`},{q:`Do you issue a GST invoice for RWA bookings in Gurgaon?`,a:`Yes, on completion, with a per-zone tick sheet and the crew names that worked each zone. RWA committees use it for the maintenance trail, and it is included at no extra cost — the price on the call is the price on the invoice.`},{q:`Gurgaon me society common area cleaning ka rate kya hai?`,a:`Lobby aur lift lobby ki safai ₹499 per visit hoti hai, ek floor ka staircase ₹299, aur parking apron ₹799. Ek poore tower ka common-area clean ₹2,499 se shuru hota hai, jismein GST invoice aur tick sheet milta hai.`}],factors:{title:`What changes the common area cleaning price`,items:[`Zone count — lobby, stairs, lift lobby, apron and clubhouse are separate lines`,`Floors in scope — staircase and corridor work is priced per floor`,`Surface type — glass balustrades and vitrified floors need a different chemistry`,`Society access — gate passes, lift slots and the RWA window are confirmed on the call`,`Frequency — a weekly common-area visit is quoted per visit, cheaper than one-offs`,`Extras — gate-pass handling and the tick sheet are included, not billed`]}},sweeper:{priceTable:{title:`Sweeper & Mop Cleaning Charges in Gurgaon`,note:`Per-visit pricing for homes, offices and societies. Weekly, bi-weekly and monthly plans are quoted per visit, cheaper than one-offs.`,head:[`Scope`,`Charges per visit`,`Time on site`,`Notes`],rows:[[`Studio or 1 RK sweep and mop`,`₹499`,`60–75 min`,`Full floor, entry and bathroom upkeep`],[`1 BHK sweep and mop`,`₹799`,`75–90 min`,`Bedroom wardrobe exteriors, balcony sweep`],[`2 BHK sweep and mop`,`₹1,199`,`90–120 min`,`Both bathrooms, dining area care`],[`3 BHK sweep and mop`,`₹1,699`,`2–3 hrs`,`Third bedroom, study, utility and balconies`],[`Commercial or office floor sweep`,`Survey-quoted`,`—`,`Priced by area and frequency`],[`Weekly plan (4 visits a month)`,`Quoted on the call`,`—`,`Same trusted team each visit`]]},qa:[{q:`How much does sweep and mop cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`Sweeping and mopping in Gurgaon starts at ₹499 per visit for a studio and reaches ₹1,699 for a 3 BHK. Weekly plans work out cheaper per visit than one-off bookings. The price is fixed for your home size, not for how long the visit happens to take.`},{q:`Is a weekly sweep and mop cheaper than a monthly deep clean?`,a:`Yes, per visit — but they do different jobs. A ₹1,199 weekly 2 BHK visit keeps the home at the same standard between visits, so the ₹4,500 deep clean is postponed by months. The plan is maintenance; the deep clean is a reset of the grout, grime and cooked grease a sweep never touches.`},{q:`Do you bring your own broom and mop in Gurgaon?`,a:`We bring a multi-surface mop, a HEPA vacuum, microfiber cloths and eco-friendly sprays. You provide water and power. The bag is the same every visit, which is why the checklist and the quality are identical whichever cleaner is dispatched.`},{q:`Can I get the same cleaner every week?`,a:`Yes. Weekly and bi-weekly plans get the same trusted team each visit, so they learn your home, your floor type and your preferences — and they clean faster over time, which is one reason the per-visit rate drops on a plan.`},{q:`What is the difference between sweep and mop and house cleaning?`,a:`They are the same thing: full dusting, HEPA vacuuming, mopping and floor care, kitchen and bathroom surface upkeep, bin emptying, high-touch sanitization. A sweep-and-mop visit is house cleaning by area — a studio is ₹499, a 3 BHK is ₹1,699, and the visit takes 60 minutes to 3 hours accordingly.`},{q:`Do you sweep and mop commercial floors in Gurgaon?`,a:`Yes — commercial floors are survey-quoted by area and frequency, and scheduled after hours so no workday is lost. Societies and offices on a recurring plan get the same team each visit and a photo trail on request.`},{q:`Gurgaon me sweep aur mop ki safai kitne ki hoti hai?`,a:`Studio ki safai ₹499, 1 BHK ₹799, 2 BHK ₹1,199, aur 3 BHK ₹1,699 per visit. Weekly plan par per-visit rate kam padta hai. Har visit par wahi trusted team aata hai, jo aapka ghar jaan le jaata hai.`}],factors:{title:`What changes the sweep and mop cleaning price`,items:[`Home size — a studio is ₹499 and a 3 BHK is ₹1,699 per visit`,`Condition — first visits after a gap run longer and are quoted upfront`,`Frequency — weekly plans drop the per-visit rate`,`Add-ons — balcony depth, utility ledges and loft detailing are separate lines`,`Surface type — marble and Kota stone need a pH-matched product`,`Scope — housekeeping upkeep, not a deep clean or a maid placement`]}},lift:{priceTable:{title:`Lift & Elevator Cleaning Charges in Gurgaon`,note:`Priced per lift. The exact figure is confirmed on the call; we carry the crew and the kit.`,head:[`Job`,`Charges`,`Time on site`,`Notes`],rows:[[`Lift cabin (interior + doors)`,`₹1,499`,`2–3 hrs`,`Cabin panels, floor, door tracks, ceiling`],[`Lift cabin + landing lobby floor`,`₹1,999`,`3–4 hrs`,`Cabin, landing lobby and floor tiles`],[`Lift cabin + shaft-side landing`,`₹2,299`,`4 hrs`,`Includes shaft landing and sill`],[`Two lifts (one building)`,`₹2,799`,`Half day`,`Both cabins in one visit`],[`Society lift block (tower)`,`From ₹4,999`,`Full day`,`All cabins plus every landing`],[`Add-on: stainless steel panel polish`,`₹499`,`45 min`,`Brushed-steel lift cabin interiors`],[`Add-on: after-hours or weekend slot`,`Included`,`—`,`Night shifts are free, no surge`]]},qa:[{q:`How much does lift cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`Lift cleaning in Gurgaon costs ₹1,499 per cabin for the interior and door tracks, ₹1,999 with the landing lobby floor, and ₹2,299 including the shaft-side landing. Two lifts in one building are ₹2,799. The crew is part of the same price, quoted on the call.`},{q:`How often should a lift be cleaned in Gurgaon?`,a:`Every three months for a residential tower and every month for a commercial building with public footfall. Gurgaon construction dust settles on cabin panels and door tracks within weeks, and the door channel is where the grit that scratches the floor collects.`},{q:`Do you clean the lift floor and door tracks too?`,a:`Yes. The cabin floor is scrubbed and the door tracks are vacuumed and wiped, because grit in the channel grinds the floor the first time the door opens. A cabin clean in Gurgaon at ₹1,499 covers panels, floor, tracks, ceiling and the door faces, not just a mop over the floor.`},{q:`Can you clean lifts in a society in Gurgaon?`,a:`Yes — a tower lift block covering every cabin plus every landing is from ₹4,999 for a full-day visit, with a per-lift tick sheet and a GST invoice. We book within the RWA window, carry IDs, and pre-share crew names for the gate pass so no slot is lost to process.`},{q:`Do you polish stainless steel lift panels?`,a:`Yes, at ₹499 per cabin, which includes removing fingerprints, smears and hard-water spots without scratching the brushed finish. It is optional and only quoted when the panel is steel rather than enamel or laminate.`},{q:`Do you clean lifts after hours in Gurgaon?`,a:`Yes, and after-hours or weekend slots are included at no extra charge. We schedule so no workday is lost and no resident queue forms — a cabin is cleaned inside a single window, with the landing lobby in the same visit.`},{q:`Gurgaon me lift cleaning ka rate kya hai?`,a:`Lift cabin ki safai ₹1,499 per lift hoti hai, jismein panel, floor, door track aur ceiling ki safai shamil hai. Landing lobby floor ke saath ₹1,999 hota hai. Society ke tower-level lift block ₹4,999 se shuru.`}],factors:{title:`What changes the lift cleaning price`,items:[`Cabin count — a building with two or more lifts needs a per-cabin line each`,`Scope — cabin only, cabin plus landing lobby, or shaft-side landing`,`Society block — a tower-level visit is priced by crate to the tower, not per lift`,`Panel material — steel panels need the polish line, laminate does not`,`Access — gate passes, lift out-of-service windows are confirmed on the call`,`Timing — after-hours and weekend slots are included, not billed`]}},windowgrill:{priceTable:{title:`Window Grill Cleaning Charges in Gurgaon`,note:`Fixed per-window pricing. The exact figure is confirmed on the call after the photo count.`,head:[`Job`,`Charges`,`Time on site`,`Notes`],rows:[[`Window grill scrub (one face)`,`₹399`,`30–45 min`,`Bars, corners and mesh disassembled where safe`],[`Window grill + mesh screen wash`,`₹499`,`45–60 min`,`Grill bars plus the mesh screen`],[`Window grill + sill and outer track`,`₹549`,`60 min`,`Bars, sill, track and channel`],[`Full window clean (grill + glass + tracks)`,`From ₹799`,`75–90 min`,`Both faces, grills and frames`],[`Rust-treatment add-on`,`₹149 per grill`,`20 min`,`Where corrosion has started`]]},qa:[{q:`How much does window grill cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`Window grill cleaning in Gurgaon costs ₹399 per window for the grill bars and corners, ₹499 with the mesh screen washed, and ₹549 including the sill and outer track. A full window clean combining grill, glass and tracks starts at ₹799.`},{q:`Do you dismantle window grills to clean them properly in Gurgaon?`,a:`Where the grill can be safely disassembled, yes. The bars are scrubbed on both faces and the recessed corners that never get a cloth through are reached with a brush. Grills that are bolted into the frame are cleaned in place and logged on the tick sheet so you know the difference.`},{q:`Why do window grills get dirty so fast in Gurgaon?`,a:`Because construction dust from the corridors films the bars within weeks and the horizontal ledges hold it. The hard-water mist from balcony drying deposits a mineral film on top. Both are physical deposits that a dry dust just moves around, which is why a wet scrub works and a wipe does not.`},{q:`Can you treat a window grill that has started rusting?`,a:`Yes, at ₹149 per grill. We scrub the corrosion, apply a rust-treatment product and then a protective finish where the surface allows it. Grills that are beyond treatment are flagged honestly on the walkthrough rather than repainted to hide it.`},{q:`Do you clean window grills before Diwali?`,a:`Yes, and it is one of the highest-value pre-Diwali items because the grill frames the window. Book it before the full-home clean so the final walk-through shows clean bars. Gurgaon festive slots fill two weeks early, so message by mid-October.`},{q:`Is it cheaper to book a full-home clean than a grill-only clean?`,a:`It can be. A grill-only clean is ₹399 per window, so a three-window flat bills ₹1,197. If the glass, tracks, kitchen and bathrooms also need a reset, the ₹2,500 1 BHK deep clean covers the grills and everything else, which works out cheaper overall.`},{q:`Gurgaon me window grill cleaning ka kharcha kya hai?`,a:`Ek window ki grill ki safai ₹399 hoti hai, jismein ki bars, corners aur ara se bane hisse ki safai shamil hoti hai. Mesh screen ke saath ₹499 aur sill aur track ke saath ₹549 hota hai.`}],factors:{title:`What changes the window grill cleaning price`,items:[`Window count — the per-window rate means a big linear gap`,`Mesh screen — washing the screen adds ₹100 per window`,`Sill and track — including them adds ₹150 per window`,`Rust condition — the treatment add-on is ₹149 per grill`,`Grill type — removable grills are cheaper than fixed bolted ones`,`Combination — a full-home clean absorbs the grills at no extra line`]}},utensils:{priceTable:{title:`Kitchen Utensils Cleaning Charges in Gurgaon`,note:`Billed per lot. The exact figure is confirmed on the call after the item list.`,head:[`Lot`,`Charges`,`Time on site`,`Notes`],rows:[[`Daily utensils (till 20 pieces)`,`₹409`,`60–90 min`,`Scrub, descale, dry and pack`],[`Standard kitchen lot (20–50 pieces)`,`₹699`,`90–120 min`,`Pressure cooker, tawa, kadahi, thali`],[`Heavy lot (50+ pieces or large vessels)`,`₹999`,`2–3 hrs`,`Steel, brass, copper and storage`],[`Storage container reset (interior + exterior)`,`₹599`,`90 min`,`Odour removal, sticky residue and lids`],[`Cutlery and serving-set wash`,`₹299`,`45 min`,`Stainless and silver-safe products`],[`Add-on: on-site dry rack and pack service`,`Free`,`Included`,`Dried, stacked and labelled back`]]},qa:[{q:`How much does kitchen utensil cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`Kitchen utensil cleaning in Gurgaon starts at ₹299 for a cutlery and serving-set wash, ₹409 for a daily lot of up to 20 pieces and ₹699 for a standard kitchen lot of 20–50 pieces. A heavy lot of 50 or more vessels is ₹999. The figure is confirmed on the call after the item list, never revised on site.`},{q:`Do you clean brass, copper and silver vessels in Gurgaon?`,a:`Yes, with metal-safe products rather than a generic detergent — brass and copper are treated for tarnish and depth, silver with a safe polish that does not strip it. If a piece is lacquered or needs a specialist polish, we tell you on the walkthrough before proceeding.`},{q:`Do you clean inside pressure cooker lids and gaskets?`,a:`Yes. The lid, the gasket, the vent pipe and the regulator come apart where they safely can, so the starch film and the oil film under the gasket are removed. That part is the one a hand wash never reaches, and it is what carries the stale smell.`},{q:`Can I book a utensil clean on its own, or is it part of a kitchen clean?`,a:`You can book it on its own. A standalone daily-lot utensil clean is ₹409 (₹299 for a cutlery and serving-set wash) and takes 60–90 minutes — useful before Diwali or after a large function when the kitchen is stacked. If the cabinets, chimney and splashback also need a reset, the ₹1,500 kitchen deep clean is better value.`},{q:`Do you dry and pack the utensils after cleaning in Gurgaon?`,a:`Yes — drying, stacking, and packing back into the storage is included at no extra charge. We dry every piece on a rack, pack them into the same cupboard section, and hand over with a count so nothing is short and nothing is wet where staff would walk.`},{q:`How long does a utensil clean take for a family kitchen?`,a:`A typical family lot of 20–50 pieces takes 90 minutes to two hours with a two-person crew. A heavy lot with large storage containers and brass vessels takes two to three hours. The timing is part of the quote, not an estimate on the day.`},{q:`Gurgaon me utensils cleaning ka price kya hai?`,a:`Cutlery aur serving-set ki safai ₹299 hoti hai, roz ke utensils (20 piece tak) ₹409, kitchen ke standard lot (20–50 piece) ₹699, aur bade bartaan ke liye ₹999. Pooja ke brass aur copper ke bartan alag product se saaf hote hain. Price call par fix hoti hai.`}],factors:{title:`What changes the utensil cleaning price`,items:[`Piece count — the lot size is the main driver of the spend and the time`,`Metal type — copper and brass need metal-specific treatment, steel does not`,`Internal mechanism — pressure cooker lids and gaskets add dismantle time`,`Storage containers — an odour and residue reset is a separate ₹599 line`,`Location — on-site cleaning avoids transport and is included in the rate`,`Pack-back — drying, stacking and labelling are included, not billed`]}},road:{priceTable:{title:`Road & Street Sweeping Charges in Gurgaon`,note:`Quoted per square foot after a look at the stretch. A minimum booking applies per visit.`,head:[`Scope`,`Charges`,`Handling`,`Notes`],rows:[[`Street and lane sweeping`,`From ₹6 per sq ft`,`Manual + mechanical`,`Dust lift, grit and litter`],[`Commercial lane and service road`,`₹7 per sq ft`,`Manual + mechanical`,`Drain-edge cleaning and disposal`],[`Society perimeter and gate road`,`From ₹4,999`,`Half day per stretch`,`Includes disposal and drain edges`],[`Construction-lane clean`,`₹8 per sq ft`,`Mechanical + water`,`Cement dust and silting`],[`Debris disposal add-on`,`Quoted on survey`,`Separate`,`We arrange licensed disposal only`]]},qa:[{q:`How much does street sweeping cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`Street sweeping in Gurgaon starts at ₹6 per sq ft for a residential stretch and ₹7 per sq ft for a commercial lane, with a minimum booking per visit. A society perimeter and gate road is from ₹4,999 for a half-day stretch, including disposal.`},{q:`Do you dispose of the swept debris in Gurgaon?`,a:`Disposal is arranged only through a licensed route and is quoted separately on the survey, because the cost depends on volume and type. We never dump in a drain, a nullah or a vacant plot — that is the single biggest compliance line on any road-sweeping booking.`},{q:`Do you sweep service roads and construction lanes in Gurgaon?`,a:`Yes. Construction lanes run at ₹8 per sq ft because cement dust and silting need mechanical sweeping followed by water, not a dry brush that just moves the dust into the drain. We schedule after the crew peak so the lane is passable the same day.`},{q:`Can a society book a road clean for a cluster day in Gurgaon?`,a:`Yes, and societies book a perimeter-and-gate clean as a single stretch from ₹4,999 for a half day. We confirm the stretch on WhatsApp, share crew names for the RWA gate pass, and hand over a photo trail the committee can file.`},{q:`How often should a society road be swept in Gurgaon?`,a:`Weekly for a gate road on an active construction corridor and monthly for an internal lane. Gurgaon dust loads the stretch within days, and the drain edges are the first place silt collects — we clean them every visit and flag blockages on the tick sheet.`},{q:`Is street sweeping cheaper on a monthly contract?`,a:`Yes — a monthly stretch contract is priced per visit at a lower rate than a one-off, and the crew learns the stretch, the drains and the access windows. The rate is fixed per visit so the RWA budget is predictable.`},{q:`Gurgaon me road sweeping ka kharcha kitna hota hai?`,a:`Street sweeping ₹6 per sq ft se shuru hoti hai, commercial lane ₹7 per sq ft, aur construction lane ₹8 per sq ft. Society ke perimeter aur gate road ke liye ₹4,999 se ek half-day stretch hota hai. Price call par fix hota hai.`}],factors:{title:`What changes the road and street sweeping price`,items:[`Stretch area — the per-sq-ft rate scales with the length and width`,`Surface type — kachcha, concrete and tarmac each need a different pass`,`Dust type — construction lanes need water and mechanical, residential do not`,`Disposal — volume and material decide the licensed-disposal cost`,`Access window — commercial lanes need night or early-morning slots`,`Frequency — a monthly stretch contract is cheaper per visit than one-offs`]}},chandelier:{priceTable:{title:`Chandelier & High-Reach Cleaning Charges in Gurgaon`,note:`Priced per unit or per high-reach fixture. Access is quoted with the clean, never improvised on the day.`,head:[`Job`,`Charges`,`Time on site`,`Notes`],rows:[[`Crystal or glass chandelier`,`₹1,499`,`2–4 hrs`,`Individual pieces dried and re-hung`],[`Metal or wrought chandelier`,`₹999`,`1.5–2 hrs`,`Tarnish treatment and protective finish`],[`High ceiling and cornice reach`,`From ₹1,999`,`Half day`,`Extension-pole work from the floor`],[`Lobby feature or statement light`,`Survey-quoted`,`—`,`Large-scale fixtures, access assessed first`],[`Add-on: lift or rope-access arrangement`,`Quoted on survey`,`—`,`Required above a safe reach height`],[`Add-on: bulb and fitting check`,`Free`,`Included`,`Flagged on the tick sheet, not replaced`]]},qa:[{q:`How much does chandelier cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`Chandelier cleaning in Gurgaon starts at ₹999 for a metal or wrought-iron unit, ₹1,499 for a crystal or glass one, and from ₹1,999 for high-ceiling and cornice reach. A unit above a safe reach height is survey-quoted because it needs access equipment, never improvised.`},{q:`Do you dismantle a chandelier to clean it in Gurgaon?`,a:`Only where the fixture can be safely reached and the pieces are individually handled. In most Gurgaon homes the unit is cleaned in place, piece by piece, dried and re-hung. Dismantling is quoted separately because it needs a rigging plan and a longer access window.`},{q:`How do you reach a chandelier in a double-height living room?`,a:`For a double-height lobby we work from the floor with extension poles up to a height, and above that we arrange a lift or rope-access as a separately quoted line. The access quote comes with the clean quote, so you see the full figure before a crew is booked.`},{q:`Can you clean lobby feature lights in Gurgaon offices?`,a:`Yes. Lobby feature and statement lights are survey-quoted because each fixture, height and access path is different, and the same unit in a residential lobby is never priced like a corporate one. GST invoices and after-hours slots are standard for office work.`},{q:`Is chandelier cleaning worth it before Diwali?`,a:`Yes. Festival lighting concentrates on the fixture a guest sees first, and dust on crystal scatters light instead of throwing it. Gurgaon festive slots fill two weeks early, so for a pre-Diwali chandelier clean message by mid-October.`},{q:`Do you clean chandeliers in societies and villas in Gurgaon?`,a:`Yes, in both. A villa or builder-floor unit is ₹1,499 and a society common lobby feature is survey-quoted. Society work needs an RWA window, a GST invoice and a per-fixture tick sheet, which are all included at no extra cost.`},{q:`Gurgaon me chandelier cleaning ka rate kya hai?`,a:`Crystal ya glass chandelier ki safai ₹1,499 hoti hai, metal ya wrought chandelier ₹999, aur high ceiling ke liye ₹1,999 se shuru. Badi height par lift access alag quote hoti hai, jo clean ke saath hi bheja jata hai.`}],factors:{title:`What changes the chandelier cleaning price`,items:[`Fixture type — crystal needs piece-by-piece handling, metal does not`,`Unit size — a 12-arm fixture takes materially longer than a 4-arm one`,`Reach height — above a safe pole height, access must be separately quoted`,`Location — a lobby feature is survey-quoted, a villa unit is not`,`Access window — after-hours or RWA windows are included at no extra charge`,`Condition — tarnish and corrosion treatment is priced when needed`]}},washingmachine:{priceTable:{title:`Washing Machine Deep Cleaning Charges in Gurgaon`,note:`Fixed per unit, quoted on the call. The drum is opened only if the machine allows it — we never force a part.`,head:[`Job`,`Charges`,`Time on site`,`Notes`],rows:[[`Front-load washer (drum + filter + seal)`,`₹799`,`90–120 min`,`Drum, pump filter, door seal, gasket`],[`Top-load washer (full body dismantle)`,`₹899`,`90–120 min`,`Tub, agitator, motor base and drain`],[`Washer + dryer combo`,`₹1,199`,`2–3 hrs`,`Both drums, seals and vents`],[`Add-on: drum odour treatment`,`₹199`,`20 min`,`For the smell a wash cycle leaves behind`],[`Add-on: drain hose and pipe flush`,`₹149`,`20 min`,`Where the machine drains slowly`],[`Old-machine deep clean (fully pulled out)`,`₹999`,`2 hrs`,`Body, base, motor area and feet`]]},qa:[{q:`How much does washing machine deep cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`Washing machine deep cleaning in Gurgaon costs ₹799 for a front-load machine and ₹899 for a top-load, covering the drum, pump filter, door seal and gasket. A washer-dryer combo is ₹1,199. The figure is confirmed on the call before the visit.`},{q:`How often should a washing machine be deep cleaned in Gurgaon?`,a:`Every 12 months for a front-load machine and every 6 to 8 months for a top-load. Gurgaon hard water leaves scale in the drum and the detergent drawer, and the rubber gasket holds moisture that turns into the smell a wash cycle then spreads across your clothes.`},{q:`Do you dismantle a washing machine to clean it?`,a:`We dismantle it as far as the manufacturer allows — the top-load tub comes out, the front-load drum and filter are accessible, and the door seal and gasket are removed and cleaned. We never force a part. Where a design does not allow access, that is flagged on the tick sheet rather than forced.`},{q:`Why does my washing machine smell even after a hot wash?`,a:`Because the smell is not in the drum. It sits in the door gasket, the detergent drawer and the pump filter, where detergent residue, lint and moisture combine. A hot wash spreads that smell into the load — removing the residue is the only thing that fixes it.`},{q:`Is washing machine cleaning included in a deep clean?`,a:`No. The ₹2,500 1 BHK deep clean covers the room, kitchen and bathroom, not the inside of a washing machine. A standalone machine clean at ₹799 is quick to book on its own, and we will happily do both in the same visit so you pay one callback.`},{q:`Can you clean an old machine that is pulled out from the wall?`,a:`Yes. An old-machine deep clean that needs the unit pulled fully out is ₹999 and takes about two hours, covering the body, the base, the motor area and the feet, which is where a decade of lint collects. The machine is put back and tested before we leave.`},{q:`Gurgaon me washing machine ki deep cleaning ka kharcha kya hai?`,a:`Front load washing machine ki deep cleaning ₹799 hoti hai aur top load ₹899, jismein drum, pump filter, door seal aur gasket ki safai shamil hai. Combo machine ₹1,199. A smells-bad machine par ₹199 ka odour treatment alag hai.`}],factors:{title:`What changes the washing machine cleaning price`,items:[`Machine type — front-load, top-load and combo are priced differently`,`Condition — heavy scale or a mouldy gasket needs a treatment pass`,`Dismantle scope — a top-load tub is more labour than a front-load drum`,`Odour treatment — a bad smell is a separate ₹199 line, not included`,`Drainage — a slow-draining machine adds a ₹149 hose and pipe flush`,`Access — an old machine that must be pulled out is ₹200 more`]}},chairclean:{priceTable:{title:`Chair & Recliner Cleaning Charges in Gurgaon`,note:`Priced per chair. Fabric, mesh and leather are treated with their own product.`,head:[`Job`,`Charges`,`Time on site`,`Notes`],rows:[[`Office chair (fabric, seat and back)`,`₹199`,`45–60 min`,`Stain pre-treatment and shampoo extraction`],[`Recliner or sofa chair`,`₹249`,`60 min`,`Heavier foam, longer extraction`],[`Gaming chair (PU or fabric)`,`₹199`,`45–60 min`,`Armrests, seams and headrest included`],[`Executive leather chair`,`₹349`,`60–75 min`,`Leather-safe clean and conditioning`],[`Stacking chair (per 4)`,`₹599`,`60 min`,`Office and cafeteria stacks`],[`Add-on: chair base and castor clean`,`₹99`,`15 min`,`Lifted off during the job`]]},qa:[{q:`How much does chair cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`Chair cleaning in Gurgaon costs ₹199 for an office or gaming chair, ₹249 for a recliner, and ₹349 for an executive leather chair. A stack of four office chairs is ₹599. The price is per chair, confirmed on the call with the chair count.`},{q:`How long does it take to clean one chair in Gurgaon?`,a:`One office chair takes 45 to 60 minutes, including stain pre-treatment, shampoo extraction and drying. A recliner takes about an hour because the foam holds more water and needs a longer extraction. A stack of four office chairs takes an hour for the whole stack.`},{q:`Do you clean mesh and leather office chairs?`,a:`Yes. Mesh is vacuumed and shampooed with a low-moisture method so the mesh does not stretch or sag, and leather gets a leather-safe clean with conditioning — never a fabric detergent, which strips and cracks it over time.`},{q:`Can you clean chairs in our Gurgaon office in one go?`,a:`Yes. Office and cafeteria stacks are priced at ₹599 for every four chairs, and we schedule the work after hours or on a weekend so no desk is unusable. For a whole floor, the count and the slot are confirmed on the call and the price is fixed before we start.`},{q:`Will my chair be dry enough to use straight after cleaning?`,a:`It is usable within a few hours, though fully dry within 8 to 12 hours depending on the foam. We air-move the chair where we can and schedule the work so you are not sitting on a wet chair the next morning. Do not cover it while damp.`},{q:`Is it worth cleaning office chairs or replacing them?`,a:`Worth cleaning when the foam is intact and the problem is dirt, odour or a stain — a shampooed chair looks materially better for a fraction of a replacement. It is not worth cleaning when the foam has collapsed or the fabric has torn, and we will say so on the walkthrough rather than take the money.`},{q:`Gurgaon me chair aur recliner cleaning ka rate kya hai?`,a:`Office chair ki safai ₹199 hoti hai, recliner ₹249, aur leather executive chair ₹349. Chaar chair ka stack ₹599 hota hai. Time lag roughly 45 se 60 minute per chair.`}],factors:{title:`What changes the chair cleaning price`,items:[`Material — fabric, mesh and leather need different products and handling`,`Chair type — a recliner has more foam and takes longer than an office chair`,`Stacking — office and cafeteria stacks are priced per four`,`Stain load — a fixed mark needs pre-treatment and adds time`,`Base and castors — a deep base clean is a ₹99 add-on`,`Scheduling — after-hours office work is included, not billed`]}},curtain:{priceTable:{title:`Curtain Vacuum & Shampoo Cleaning Charges in Gurgaon`,note:`Priced per set of up to four panels. Heavy and blackout fabrics are quoted on the call.`,head:[`Job`,`Charges`,`Time on site`,`Notes`],rows:[[`Curtain set (up to 4 panels, light fabric)`,`₹499`,`45–60 min`,`Vacuum, spot clean, deodorise`],[`Curtain set (up to 4 panels, shampoo)`,`₹699`,`60–90 min`,`Wet extraction, hung to dry`],[`Heavy or blackout curtain set`,`₹899`,`90–120 min`,`Slower drying, thicker pile`],[`Curtains + sofa set (up to 4 + 2 panels)`,`₹999`,`2 hrs`,`Done together in one visit`],[`Add-on: curtain rod and track clean`,`₹99`,`15 min`,`Included in the set price on request`]]},qa:[{q:`How much does curtain cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`Curtain cleaning in Gurgaon costs ₹499 per set of up to four light panels and ₹699 when a wet shampoo is needed. Heavy or blackout fabric is ₹899 per set. A curtain-plus-sofa set is ₹999 for one visit.`},{q:`Are curtains cleaned on site or taken away in Gurgaon?`,a:`On site. We vacuum and treat the curtains where they hang, then leave them to dry in place, so there is no waiting period and no risk of lost or damaged panels. Heavy blackout fabric takes longest to dry and is quoted accordingly.`},{q:`How long do curtains take to dry after cleaning?`,a:`Light fabric dries in four to six hours, and heavy blackout fabric takes eight to twelve. We schedule so the windows are usable and you can close them for the night. We never rehang a curtain that is still damp.`},{q:`Does curtain cleaning remove the smell of damp or smoke in Gurgaon?`,a:`Yes, usually. The smell sits in the fabric, the dust that has worked into the pleats and the accumulated body oil along the top edge, and a deodorising pass with a proper extraction removes it. Where the odour is in the fabric itself and cannot be lifted, we say so before you pay.`},{q:`How often should curtains be cleaned in Gurgaon?`,a:`Every six to nine months for normal use, and every four to six for a home near a construction site or a main road, where the dust load is much higher. It also depends on whether you run the AC on a window seat, which pulls more dust into the pleats.`},{q:`Do you clean the curtain rod and track as well?`,a:`Yes, at no extra charge as part of the set clean. The rod and track collect more dust than the fabric and are the first thing you see when the curtain is closed, so we wipe them down as part of the job rather than charging a separate line.`},{q:`Gurgaon me curtain cleaning ka kharcha kitna hai?`,a:`Chaar panels tak ka curtain set ₹499 hota hai, aur shampoo ₹699. Heavy ya blackout fabric ₹899. Curtain aur sofa ek saath ₹999 me ho jata hai. Sab kuch on-site hota hai.`}],factors:{title:`What changes the curtain cleaning price`,items:[`Fabric weight — blackout and heavy material needs a slower, wetter process`,`Cleaning method — a dry deodorise is cheaper than a wet shampoo`,`Number of panels — priced per set of up to four`,`Drying time — heavy fabric is quoted at more time because it dries slowly`,`Access — high or awkward windows change the time on site`,`Rod and track — cleaned as part of the set, never billed separately`]}},basement:{priceTable:{title:`Unfinished Basement & Godown Cleaning Charges in Gurgaon`,note:`Quoted per square foot after a look at the photos. Debris weight decides the disposal line.`,head:[`Scope`,`Charges`,`Handling`,`Notes`],rows:[[`Unfinished basement (light dust)`,`₹12 per sq ft`,`Sweep, HEPA, mop`,`1,000 sq ft in 5–6 hrs`],[`Godown with stored material`,`₹14 per sq ft`,`Sweep, HEPA, mop`,`Stored items moved by us`],[`Heavy debris and cobweb removal`,`₹18 per sq ft`,`Mechanical + manual`,`Corners, ceiling and beams`],[`Water-damage or mould affected area`,`Survey-quoted`,`Separate treatment`,`Drying and remediation quoted first`],[`Debris disposal`,`Quoted on survey`,`Licensed route only`,`Volume and material decide the cost`]]},qa:[{q:`How much does basement cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`Unfinished basement and godown cleaning in Gurgaon starts at ₹12 per sq ft, rising to ₹14 for a space with stored material and ₹18 for heavy debris and cobwebs. A 1,000 sq ft godown takes 5 to 6 hours with a two-person crew.`},{q:`How long does it take to clean a 1,000 sq ft basement?`,a:`A 1,000 sq ft unfinished basement takes five to six hours with a two-person crew — sweeping, HEPA vacuuming, corner and cobweb work, then mopping the floor. Heavily stored or debris-heavy spaces take longer, and the time is in the quote rather than an estimate on the day.`},{q:`Will you move stored goods to clean underneath?`,a:`Yes, we move what we can lift and clean underneath, then put it back in the same place. Anything heavy, fragile or stacked higher than the crew can safely handle is left in place and the area around it is cleaned and logged on the tick sheet.`},{q:`Do you clean basements with damp or mould in Gurgaon?`,a:`We clean the surface, but a damp or mould-affected area is survey-quoted separately because it needs drying and remediation before a normal clean will hold. We tell you on the walkthrough what we can treat and what needs a different trade, rather than quoting a clean that will not stick.`},{q:`Can you clean a commercial godown in Gurugram?`,a:`Yes. Godown and basement cleaning is survey-quoted for commercial spaces, and we issue a GST invoice with a photo trail, which is what most facility teams need for their records. Night and weekend scheduling is available so no working day is lost.`},{q:`Is debris removal included in the basement cleaning price?`,a:`No — disposal is quoted separately after a survey, because the cost depends on the volume and the material. We use a licensed disposal route only, and we never dump in a drain, a nullah or a vacant plot. The clean and the disposal are always two clear lines.`},{q:`Gurgaon me basement aur godown cleaning ka rate kya hai?`,a:`Light dust wale basement ki safai ₹12 per sq ft se shuru hoti hai, saman rakhe godown ₹14, aur heavy debris ₹18. Ek 1,000 sq ft godown 5 se 6 ghante me hota hai. Debris disposal alag quote hota hai.`}],factors:{title:`What changes the basement cleaning price`,items:[`Dust and debris load — light dust, stored material and heavy debris are three tiers`,`Area — the per-sq-ft rate scales with the floor area`,`Stored goods — what we can move and lift changes the crew time`,`Access — ramp, stair or lift access to a basement is confirmed on the call`,`Damp or mould — a separate remediation quote before the clean`,`Disposal — volume and material decide the licensed-disposal cost`]}},instantclean:{priceTable:{title:`Instant & Same-Day Cleaning Charges in Gurgaon`,note:`A fixed same-day package, dispatched within four hours of booking. Availability is confirmed on the call.`,head:[`Package`,`Charges`,`Crew`,`Notes`],rows:[[`Instant clean — 1 BHK`,`₹999`,`2 cleaners`,`Kitchen, bathroom, bedroom, living area`],[`Instant clean — 2 BHK`,`₹1,499`,`2–3 cleaners`,`Both bathrooms, balcony and floors`],[`Instant clean — 3 BHK`,`₹1,999`,`3–4 cleaners`,`All baths, balcony, utility and wardrobes`],[`Urgent bathroom only (same day)`,`₹799`,`1–2 cleaners`,`One bathroom, full descale and disinfect`],[`Urgent kitchen only (same day)`,`₹1,199`,`2 cleaners`,`Chimney, hob, cabinets, tiles and floor`],[`After 8 pm surcharge`,`₹0`,`—`,`Evening slots are charged at the same rate`]]},qa:[{q:`How much does same-day cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`Same-day cleaning in Gurgaon starts at ₹799 for a single urgent bathroom, then ₹999 for a 1 BHK, ₹1,499 for a 2 BHK and ₹1,999 for a 3 BHK, with a 2 to 4 person crew. An urgent kitchen is ₹1,199. The price is the same in the evening as in the morning.`},{q:`How fast can you send a cleaning crew in Gurgaon?`,a:`We dispatch within four hours of booking for same-day slots, which is why the package is scoped rather than a full deep clean. A 2 to 3 person crew takes a 2 BHK through kitchen, bathrooms, bedrooms, balcony and floors in four to five hours.`},{q:`What is the difference between instant cleaning and a deep clean?`,a:`An instant clean is a same-day top-to-bottom reset scoped to a fixed checklist — kitchen, bathrooms, bedrooms, living area, floors and balcony. A deep clean adds machine scrubbing, wardrobe interiors, window tracks and a supervisor walkthrough. The instant package gets you to a clean flat today; the deep clean resets the grout and grime.`},{q:`Can I get a same-day bathroom clean in Gurgaon?`,a:`Yes. An urgent same-day bathroom clean is ₹799 for one bathroom with a full descale, commode sanitization, mirror and floor work, and one to two cleaners. It is the fastest way to fix a bathroom before a guest arrives or a visitor is expected.`},{q:`Do you charge more for evening or weekend slots?`,a:`No. After 8 pm and weekend slots are charged at the same rate as a morning slot, and the after-hours availability is included in the package. We do not add a surge, because a fake premium for a booked slot is not how we run the business.`},{q:`How do I confirm a same-day slot in Gurgaon?`,a:`Message on WhatsApp with your locality, home size and the time you need it by. We confirm the nearest crew and the arrival window on the call, usually within 30 minutes. Same-day slots depend on crew availability, so it is worth booking early in the day rather than at night.`},{q:`Gurgaon me same day cleaning ka rate kya hai?`,a:`Same day cleaning 1 BHK ke liye ₹999, 2 BHK ₹1,499 aur 3 BHK ₹1,999. Sirf ek bathroom urgent karwana ho to ₹799 aur kitchen ₹1,199. Shaam ko koi extra charge nahi lagta.`}],factors:{title:`What changes the same-day cleaning price`,items:[`Home size — the package is priced per BHK, from ₹999 for a 1 BHK`,`Scope — a full package, one bathroom or one kitchen are separate lines`,`Crew size — a 3 BHK needs three or four cleaners to hold the same window`,`Arrival window — the tighter the window, the earlier we need the booking`,`Condition — a heavily soiled flat takes longer and is scoped before dispatch`,`Timing — evening and weekend slots carry no premium`]}},balconyclean:{priceTable:{title:`Balcony Cleaning Charges in Gurgaon`,note:`Priced per balcony. The exact figure is confirmed on the call after a photo of the balcony.`,head:[`Scope`,`Charges`,`Time on site`,`Notes`],rows:[[`Balcony pressure wash and scrub`,`₹399`,`45–60 min`,`Tiles, joints, edges and drains`],[`Balcony + glass panel and railing`,`₹499`,`60 min`,`Rail, glass and the frame`],[`Balcony + pigeon-dropping treatment`,`₹599`,`75 min`,`Treatment and manual removal`],[`Two balconies (same flat)`,`₹699`,`2 hrs`,`Second balcony at ₹300`],[`Large balcony or terrace (over 100 sq ft)`,`₹799`,`90 min`,`Quoted after a photo`]]},qa:[{q:`How much does balcony cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`Balcony cleaning in Gurgaon costs ₹399 per balcony for a pressure wash and scrub, ₹499 with the glass panel and railing, and ₹599 with pigeon-dropping treatment. Two balconies in the same flat are ₹699. The price is confirmed on the call after a photo.`},{q:`How long does one balcony take to clean in Gurgaon?`,a:`A typical Gurgaon balcony takes 45 to 60 minutes for a pressure wash, scrub and drain flush. Adding the glass panel and railing takes about an hour in total, and pigeon-dropping treatment takes 75 minutes because the treatment needs its own contact time before removal.`},{q:`Do you clear blocked balcony drains?`,a:`We flush and clear light silt from the drain as part of the wash, because that is the most common cause of a blocked balcony drain in Gurgaon. A blockage deeper in the pipe is a separate plumbing job, and we flag it on the tick sheet rather than pretend it is cleaned.`},{q:`Can you remove pigeon droppings from a balcony?`,a:`Yes, at ₹599 with the balcony clean, which includes a treatment that loosens the droppings before removal. We wear protective gear and work from the outer edge where it is safe, and we do not treat a balcony where a droppings fall on a neighbour below without checking.`},{q:`Is balcony cleaning worth it before the monsoon in Gurgaon?`,a:`Yes, and it is most valuable just before the monsoon rather than after. Dust, grit and dried pigeon droppings on a balcony tile block the drainage path, and that is what causes the overflow many Gurgaon flats see in the first heavy rain. A ₹399 wash before June is cheaper than water damage.`},{q:`Do you clean the balcony of a society flat in Gurgaon?`,a:`Yes, and it is often booked as part of the full-home deep clean. A standalone balcony clean is ₹399, or ₹699 for two. For society buildings, the booking goes through the RWA window and the cost is a normal per-balcony rate with a GST invoice on request.`},{q:`Gurgaon me balcony cleaning ka rate kya hai?`,a:`Ek balcony ki pressure wash aur scrub ₹399 hoti hai, glass panel aur railing ke saath ₹499, aur pigeon dropping treatment ₹599. Do balcony ek hi flat me ₹699 lagte hain.`}],factors:{title:`What changes the balcony cleaning price`,items:[`Size — a balcony over 100 sq ft is quoted separately`,`Glass and railing — adding the panel and rail moves it to ₹499`,`Pigeon droppings — treatment is a separate ₹599 line`,`Drain condition — deep blockage is plumbing, not cleaning`,`Number of balconies — the second balcony in a flat is ₹300`,`Safety — droppings falling on a neighbour below need checking first`]}},sqftrate:{priceTable:{title:`Deep Cleaning Rate Per Square Foot in Gurgaon`,note:`Two published ways to buy the same job. The BHK card is fixed; the per-sq-ft rate is pro-rata from it.`,head:[`Home size`,`Per sq ft`,`BHK card`,`Typical time on site`],rows:[[`1 RK / studio (up to 400 sq ft)`,`₹3 per sq ft`,`₹2,000`,`3–4 hrs`],[`1 BHK (400–600 sq ft)`,`₹3 per sq ft`,`₹2,500`,`4–5 hrs`],[`2 BHK (601–1,000 sq ft)`,`₹3 per sq ft`,`₹4,500`,`5–6 hrs`],[`3 BHK (1,001–1,500 sq ft)`,`₹3 per sq ft`,`₹5,500`,`6–7 hrs`],[`4 BHK (1,501–2,100 sq ft)`,`₹3 per sq ft`,`₹6,500`,`7–8 hrs`],[`5 BHK / villa (2,100+ sq ft)`,`₹3 per sq ft`,`From ₹9,000`,`8–9 hrs`],[`Furnished home`,`Add ₹500–₹1,500`,`Add ₹500–₹1,500`,`Adds 1–2 hrs`]]},qa:[{q:`What is the deep cleaning rate per square foot in Gurgaon?`,a:`Deep cleaning in Gurgaon works out to about ₹3 per square foot, pro-rata from a fixed BHK card: 1 BHK ₹2,500, 2 BHK ₹4,500, 3 BHK ₹5,500, 4 BHK ₹6,500 and 5 BHK or villa from ₹9,000. The BHK figure is what we quote, because a per-sq-ft rate alone hides what is included.`},{q:`Is the per-square-foot rate cheaper than the BHK card?`,a:`On a 1,300 sq ft flat the BHK card usually costs less than the same scope priced by area alone, because a pure area-based rate does not price wardrobe interiors, balcony drains, window tracks, fan and AC vent detailing or appliance interiors. The saving is real, but it is a scope difference, not a discount on the same work.`},{q:`How do you calculate the price for my home in Gurgaon?`,a:`We count built-up area from your floor plan or the photos you send, then map it to the BHK band. A 1 BHK at 400 to 600 sq ft is ₹2,500, a 2 BHK at 601 to 1,000 sq ft is ₹4,500, and a 3 BHK at 1,001 to 1,500 sq ft is ₹5,500. The figure is locked on the call before the crew is booked.`},{q:`Why do you quote by BHK instead of by square foot?`,a:`Because area does not predict the work. Two 900 sq ft homes can differ completely: one has three bathrooms and an empty kitchen, the other has one bathroom, a furnished bedroom and a heavy kitchen. The BHK card plus the condition of the home is what predicts the hours, so that is what we price on.`},{q:`What changes the price if my flat is furnished?`,a:`A furnished home adds ₹500 to ₹1,500 and one to two hours, because wardrobe interiors, sofa detailing, under-bed and behind-furniture work take real time. We confirm it from the photos before quoting, so the figure you get is the figure you pay on the day.`},{q:`Does the per-square-foot rate include the same checklist?`,a:`Yes, when you book the BHK card — the scope is identical, only the way it is expressed differs. If a competitor quotes you a lower per-sq-ft number, ask what is in it: wardrobe interiors, balcony drains, window tracks, fan and vent detailing, or appliance interiors are where the real differences sit.`},{q:`Gurgaon me deep cleaning per square foot ka rate kitna hai?`,a:`Deep cleaning ka rate approximately ₹3 per sq ft hota hai, lekin hum fixed BHK card par quote karte hain — 1 BHK ₹2,500, 2 BHK ₹4,500, 3 BHK ₹5,500, 4 BHK ₹6,500, 5 BHK ya villa ₹9,000 se. Area se rate nahi, BHK aur condition se time aur price tay hota hai.`}],factors:{title:`What changes the deep cleaning price per square foot`,items:[`Built-up area — the rate is pro-rata from the BHK band`,`Number of bathrooms — a third bathroom is a real descaling cycle`,`Furnishings — wardrobe interiors and under-furniture work add ₹500–₹1,500`,`Condition — a long gap since the last clean needs more hours`,`Surfaces — marble and Kota need pH-matched chemistry, vitrified does not`,`Access — floor, lift and parking conditions affect the crew-hours`]}},kitchenplatform:{priceTable:{title:`Kitchen Platform Deep Cleaning Charges in Gurgaon`,note:`Fixed per kitchen, confirmed on the call. Chimney, hob and cabinet interiors are quoted separately.`,head:[`Scope`,`Charges`,`Time on site`,`Notes`],rows:[[`Kitchen platform deep clean`,`₹999`,`2–3 hrs`,`Platform, edges, backsplash and sink base`],[`Platform + cabinet interiors`,`₹1,399`,`3–4 hrs`,`Empty cabinets, inner shelves and doors`],[`Platform + chimney filter dismantle`,`₹1,599`,`3–4 hrs`,`Filter soak, degrease and suction test`],[`Platform + hob and exhaust degrease`,`₹1,299`,`2.5–3.5 hrs`,`Burners, grates and the exhaust body`],[`Full kitchen deep clean`,`₹1,500`,`3–4 hrs`,`The complete 9-area kitchen scope`]]},qa:[{q:`How much does kitchen platform deep cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`Kitchen platform deep cleaning in Gurgaon is ₹999 for the platform, edges, backsplash and sink base, ₹1,399 with the cabinet interiors, and ₹1,599 with the chimney filter dismantled and degreased. A full kitchen deep clean is ₹1,500 for the complete scope.`},{q:`How long does a kitchen platform clean take in Gurgaon?`,a:`A platform-only deep clean takes 2 to 3 hours with a two-person crew, because the platform, the edges and the backsplash joint all need separate product and dwell time. Adding the cabinet interiors or a chimney filter takes it to 3 to 4 hours.`},{q:`Do you clean inside the kitchen cabinets?`,a:`Yes, at ₹1,399 including the platform. Cabinets are emptied, the inner shelves and doors are wiped, and the sticky grease film on the vertical panels is removed — the part that is invisible until you open the door and a drop lands on the floor.`},{q:`Do you dismantle the chimney filter for a platform clean?`,a:`Only in the ₹1,599 package, where the filter comes off, soaks in a food-safe degreaser and is degreased before it goes back, with a suction test at the end. A platform clean on its own does not touch the chimney, because a filter job needs its own soak time.`},{q:`Is a platform clean enough before Diwali in Gurgaon?`,a:`For most homes, yes. The platform, edges and backsplash are what you see and what a cook touches daily, and ₹999 handles that. If the chimney has not been cleaned in a year, add the ₹600 filter job — a greasy filter is what pushes the smell back into the kitchen after the platform is spotless.`},{q:`Do you clean the hob and exhaust as part of a platform clean?`,a:`Not in the platform-only package. The hob, grates and exhaust body are ₹1,299 with the platform, or ₹1,500 inside the full kitchen deep clean. They are separated because a burnt burner needs a different product and dwell time from a greasy platform.`},{q:`Gurgaon me kitchen platform cleaning ka price kya hai?`,a:`Kitchen platform ki deep cleaning ₹999 hoti hai, cabinet interiors ke saath ₹1,399, aur chimney filter dismantle ke saath ₹1,599. Poore kitchen ka deep clean ₹1,500 me 2 se 4 ghante me hota hai.`}],factors:{title:`What changes the kitchen platform cleaning price`,items:[`Cabinet interiors — the ₹400 add-on covers emptying, wiping and the door panels`,`Chimney filter — dismantle, soak and a suction test are a separate line`,`Hob and exhaust — burnt burners need a different product and dwell time`,`Platform material — granite and quartz are cleaned differently to tile`,`Grease load — a kitchen that has not been cleaned in a year takes longer`,`Timing — a pre-Diwali kitchen slot should be booked two weeks ahead`]}},postconstruction:{priceTable:{title:`Post-Construction Cleaning Charges in Gurgaon`,note:`A three-phase job priced by area. The exact figure is confirmed after a site visit or a video walkthrough.`,head:[`Phase`,`What it covers`,`Charges`,`Timing`],rows:[[`Phase 1 — Rough`,`Debris haul, cement dust, brick and plaster removal`,`Included`,`Day 1`],[`Phase 2 — High surfaces`,`Beams, ledges, window frames, vent covers, grills`,`Included`,`Day 1`],[`Phase 3 — Final`,`HEPA fine dust, paint spot removal, mirrors, polish`,`Included`,`Day 1–2`],[`1 BHK (up to 600 sq ft)`,`Complete three-phase clean`,`From ₹2,499`,`1 day`],[`2 BHK (601–1,000 sq ft)`,`Complete three-phase clean`,`From ₹3,499`,`1–2 days`],[`3 BHK (1,001–1,500 sq ft)`,`Complete three-phase clean`,`From ₹4,499`,`2 days`]]},qa:[{q:`How much does post-construction cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`Post-construction cleaning in Gurgaon starts at ₹2,499 for a 1 BHK up to 600 sq ft, ₹3,499 for a 2 BHK and ₹4,499 for a 3 BHK. It is a three-phase job — rough debris, then high surfaces, then a final HEPA pass — and the price covers all three phases on every size.`},{q:`How long does post-construction cleaning take in Gurgaon?`,a:`A 1 BHK takes one day, a 2 BHK one to two days and a 3 BHK two days. The job runs in three phases because construction dust re-settles: clear the rough debris and plaster first, then the high surfaces, then the final HEPA pass so you are not left with a film on the day of possession.`},{q:`What is the difference between post-construction cleaning and a normal deep clean?`,a:`A normal deep clean works on settled household grime. Post-construction cleaning handles construction debris, cement dust, plaster, paint spots and silicone residue, and it needs the phase order so the final HEPA pass happens last. A deep clean on a dusty flat would just move the dust around.`},{q:`Do you remove construction debris in Gurgaon?`,a:`Yes, in phase one — plaster, brick, chippings and the general debris haul, with the disposal arranged through a licensed route. Larger volumes are quoted separately after a survey, because the cost depends on the weight and the material.`},{q:`Do you remove paint and cement marks from tiles in Gurgaon?`,a:`Yes, in the final phase, using a product matched to the surface so glass, vitrified and metal are not scratched. Marks that have etched into the tile itself lighten rather than vanish, and we say so on the walkthrough before you pay.`},{q:`When should I book post-construction cleaning before possession in Gurgaon?`,a:`Book it two or three days before your possession date, once the builder has finished the last cut and the dust has settled. If the builder is still working, we will clean, and the next day the dust returns — so the timing matters more than the booking.`},{q:`Gurgaon me post construction cleaning ka kharcha kitna hai?`,a:`Post construction cleaning 1 BHK (600 sq ft tak) ke liye ₹2,499 se, 2 BHK ₹3,499 aur 3 BHK ₹4,499. Ye teen phase me hota hai — debris, high surfaces, aur final HEPA pass — aur size ke hisaab se 1 se 2 din lagte hain.`}],factors:{title:`What changes the post-construction cleaning price`,items:[`Built-up area — 1, 2 and 3 BHK bands are priced separately`,`Debris volume — heavy plaster and brick haul is quoted after a survey`,`Paint and cement marks — etched marks need more dwell time`,`High surfaces and glass — façade and window work adds crew hours`,`Occupancy timing — a booking made before the builder finishes is wasted`,`Disposal — construction debris goes through a licensed route`]}},roomclean:{priceTable:{title:`Single Room Cleaning Charges in Gurgaon`,note:`Per room, fixed. A whole-home deep clean is often better value — we will tell you which applies.`,head:[`Room`,`Charges`,`Time on site`,`Notes`],rows:[[`Single bedroom or living room`,`₹299`,`60–90 min`,`Dust, vacuum, mop, skirting and windows`],[`Kitchenette (single kitchen)`,`₹399`,`60–90 min`,`Platform, cabinets, sink and floor`],[`Single bathroom`,`₹399`,`45–60 min`,`Descale, sanitise, mirror, tiles and floor`],[`Study or kids room`,`₹299`,`60 min`,`Desk, shelves, chair and skirting`],[`Two rooms`,`₹499`,`2 hrs`,`Second room at ₹200`],[`Full-home deep clean (1 BHK)`,`₹2,500`,`4–5 hrs`,`The whole flat, checklist, walkthrough`]]},qa:[{q:`How much does single room cleaning cost in Gurgaon?`,a:`Single room cleaning in Gurgaon is ₹299 for a bedroom, living room or study, ₹399 for a kitchenette and ₹399 for a bathroom. Two rooms are ₹499. The price is fixed for the room type and confirmed on the call.`},{q:`How long does one room take to clean in Gurgaon?`,a:`A bedroom, living room or study takes 60 to 90 minutes with one cleaner, including dusting, vacuuming, mopping, skirting and the inside of the window glass. A bathroom takes 45 to 60 minutes because the descaling dwell time cannot be rushed.`},{q:`Is a single room clean worth it, or should I book a deep clean?`,a:`For one neglected room, yes — a ₹299 room clean is the cheapest way to fix one bad space. But if several rooms, the kitchen and the bathrooms all need it, the ₹2,500 1 BHK deep clean is better value and covers the whole flat with a supervisor walkthrough.`},{q:`Do you clean the inside of the windows in a room clean?`,a:`Yes, the glass and the tracks are included, because a wiped frame with a dusty track is the most common giveaway of a rushed clean. We vacuum the channel out and wipe the sill and glass as part of the room scope.`},{q:`Can I book two rooms on the same visit?`,a:`Yes, two rooms are ₹499, so a bedroom and a study on the same visit is cheaper than booking them separately. Beyond two rooms, the full-home deep clean usually works out better, and we will say so rather than selling you rooms one at a time.`},{q:`Do you move furniture to clean a single room in Gurgaon?`,a:`We move light furniture — chairs, side tables, a movable stool — to clean under and behind it, and we put it back. We do not move heavy or wall-mounted items, and anything that needs lifting is logged on the tick sheet instead.`},{q:`Gurgaon me single room cleaning ka price kya hai?`,a:`Ek bedroom, living room ya study ki safai ₹299 hoti hai, kitchenette ₹399 aur bathroom ₹399. Do room ek visit me ₹499 lagte hain. Poore ghar ka deep clean ₹2,500 se shuru hota hai.`}],factors:{title:`What changes the single room cleaning price`,items:[`Room type — a kitchenette and a bathroom cost more than a bedroom`,`Room count — the second room is ₹200, beyond two the deep clean is cheaper`,`Condition — a long-unused room needs more hours and a stronger product`,`Windows — inside glass and track cleaning are included in the room scope`,`Furniture — light items are moved and reset, heavy items are not`,`Add-ons — a stain, an odour or a stain-specific treatment is quoted separately`]}}},t={1:{cost:{q:`How much does full home deep cleaning cost for a 1 BHK in Gurgaon?`,a:`A 1 BHK full home deep clean in Gurgaon costs ₹2,500 for a non-furnished flat, covering 400–600 sq ft over 4–5 hours with two cleaners. A furnished 1 BHK adds ₹500–₹1,500 for the sofa, dining units and extra wardrobes. The price includes machines, products, travel and the final walkthrough.`},time:{q:`How long does a 1 BHK full home deep clean take?`,a:`Four to five hours, with two cleaners on site. That is enough time for the bedroom and its wardrobes, one bathroom fully descaled, a modular kitchen with the chimney filter dismantled and soaked, the living area and the balcony floors. A furnished 1 BHK adds an hour for sofa and wardrobe detailing.`}},2:{cost:{q:`How much does full home deep cleaning cost for a 2 BHK in Gurgaon?`,a:`A 2 BHK full home deep clean in Gurgaon costs ₹4,500 for a non-furnished flat, covering 601–1,000 sq ft over 5–6 hours with two to three cleaners. Furnished 2 BHKs with a sofa, dining table and extra wardrobes run ₹5,000–₹5,500. The price includes machines, products, travel and the final walkthrough.`},time:{q:`How long does a 2 BHK full home deep clean take?`,a:`Five to six hours, with two to three cleaners on site. That is enough time for both bedrooms and their wardrobes, two bathrooms fully descaled, a modular kitchen with the chimney filter dismantled and soaked, the living area and the balcony floors. A furnished 2 BHK adds an hour for sofa and wardrobe detailing.`}},3:{cost:{q:`How much does full home deep cleaning cost for a 3 BHK in Gurgaon?`,a:`A 3 BHK full home deep clean in Gurgaon costs ₹5,500 for a non-furnished flat, covering 1,001–1,500 sq ft over 6–7 hours with three to four cleaners. A furnished 3 BHK adds ₹500–₹1,500 for the sofa, dining units and extra wardrobes. The price includes machines, products, travel and the final walkthrough.`},time:{q:`How long does a 3 BHK full home deep clean take?`,a:`Six to seven hours, with three to four cleaners on site. That is enough time for three bedrooms and their wardrobes, two or three bathrooms fully descaled, a modular kitchen with the chimney filter dismantled and soaked, AC vent covers opened and dusted, and every ceiling fan wiped blade by blade. A furnished 3 BHK adds one to two hours.`}},4:{cost:{q:`How much does full home deep cleaning cost for a 4 BHK in Gurgaon?`,a:`A 4 BHK full home deep clean in Gurgaon costs ₹6,500 for a non-furnished flat, covering 1,501–2,100 sq ft over 7–8 hours with four to five cleaners. A furnished 4 BHK adds ₹500–₹1,500 for the sofa, dining units and extra wardrobes. The price includes machines, products, travel and the final walkthrough.`},time:{q:`How long does a 4 BHK full home deep clean take?`,a:`Seven to eight hours, with four to five cleaners on site — a full working day for four bedrooms and their wardrobes, three or four bathrooms fully descaled, the terrace and the balconies. Marble-safe products are used on the floors.`}},5:{cost:{q:`How much does full home deep cleaning cost for a 5 BHK or villa in Gurgaon?`,a:`A 5 BHK or villa deep clean in Gurgaon costs ₹9,000 for a non-furnished home, covering 2,500–3,000 sq ft over 8–9 hours with five cleaners. A furnished villa adds ₹500–₹1,500 for the sofa, dining units and extra wardrobes. The price includes machines, products, travel and the final walkthrough.`},time:{q:`How long does a 5 BHK or villa deep clean take?`,a:`Eight to nine hours, with five cleaners on site — one full working day for five bedrooms, four or more bathrooms fully descaled, the terrace and the balconies, with finish-specific products on the floors.`}}};export{e as n,t};